<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:04.799" end="00:00:08.880" style="s2">Ivy, you&#39;re nothing but dead weight,</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.200" end="00:00:10.480" style="s2">coasting on your engagement to Chase,</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.880" end="00:00:12.880" style="s2">and you think you can laugh at me in</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.480" end="00:00:15.440" style="s2">public? I&#39;ll put you in your place right</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.880" end="00:00:17.600" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.440" end="00:00:20.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, my ankle.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.600" end="00:00:21.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, that was out of line. Apologize to</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.080" end="00:00:27.320" style="s2">Sasha now.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.359" end="00:00:27.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologize to her. She&#39;s not worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.519" end="00:00:33.640" style="s2">Dad, you heard that? This is the fiance</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.080" end="00:00:33.640" style="s2">you picked for me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.990" end="00:00:42.239" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.760" end="00:00:43.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, Chase has a big deal to close. He</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.239" end="00:00:45.520" style="s2">won&#39;t be able to make it to the</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.120" end="00:00:48.239" style="s2">engagement party next week.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.520" end="00:00:50.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see. Cancel it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.239" end="00:00:51.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not upset. It&#39;s your engagement</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.079" end="00:00:53.039" style="s2">party.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.200" end="00:00:55.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would I be? I&#39;m not the one losing</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.039" end="00:00:56.800" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.120" end="00:00:59.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, this is your birthday present from</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.800" end="00:01:03.480" style="s2">dad. You like it? Perfect. Time to go</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.680" end="00:01:03.480" style="s2">collect my birthday present.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.720" end="00:01:09.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, this island belongs to the</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.360" end="00:01:11.360" style="s2">Kane family. We&#39;re only here because I</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.840" end="00:01:13.840" style="s2">landed us a shot at partnering with the</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.360" end="00:01:16.159" style="s2">Cane Air, Miss Kane herself. We&#39;re just</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.840" end="00:01:19.520" style="s2">waiting on the final signature.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.159" end="00:01:21.040" style="s2">No way. Sasha is amazing. She actually</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.520" end="00:01:21.920" style="s2">got us a meeting with a family like the</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.040" end="00:01:24.080" style="s2">Canes.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.920" end="00:01:25.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Sasha for you. Not like certain</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.080" end="00:01:27.759" style="s2">people who just write an engagement</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.439" end="00:01:30.400" style="s2">contract and hang around Chase. You mean</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.759" end="00:01:32.560" style="s2">Chase&#39;s fianceé, Ivy? Without that</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.400" end="00:01:33.920" style="s2">engagement, a woman like her, Chase</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.560" end="00:01:35.439" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t even look twice.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.920" end="00:01:38.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha&#39;s the one who actually fits with</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.439" end="00:01:41.960" style="s2">Chase. You guys are too sweet. Standing</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.000" end="00:01:41.960" style="s2">next to Chase is an honor.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.079" end="00:01:49.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at that yacht.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.960" end="00:01:49.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. Is that the Cane Air?</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.386" end="00:01:51.406" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.680" end="00:01:55.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is she doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.719" end="00:02:06.600" style="s2">Dad, I&#39;m on the island.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.640" end="00:02:06.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did she follow me here?</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.360" end="00:02:11.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, you followed me. It&#39;s been a few</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.920" end="00:02:14.239" style="s2">days and you can&#39;t stay away from me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.360" end="00:02:15.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of all the people to run into, great.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.239" end="00:02:17.840" style="s2">This is the Kane family&#39;s private</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.680" end="00:02:20.000" style="s2">island. Everyone here is dressed for the</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.840" end="00:02:21.280" style="s2">occasion and you show up like that.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.000" end="00:02:22.640" style="s2">What? Did you spend all your money on</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.280" end="00:02:25.920" style="s2">the yacht and couldn&#39;t afford real</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.640" end="00:02:29.160" style="s2">clothes? I&#39;m at home. I&#39;ll wear whatever</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.920" end="00:02:29.160" style="s2">I want.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.996" end="00:02:32.239" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.720" end="00:02:33.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you just say she&#39;s at home? Does she</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.239" end="00:02:34.879" style="s2">think she&#39;s Mrs. Kane?</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.599" end="00:02:36.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The less someone has, the more they</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.879" end="00:02:37.920" style="s2">brag. Today, I&#39;ve seen it all. No wonder</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.400" end="00:02:39.040" style="s2">Chase can&#39;t stand her. Next to Sasha,</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.920" end="00:02:40.239" style="s2">she&#39;s not even in the same league.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.040" end="00:02:41.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, ignore her. We&#39;ve got other</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.239" end="00:02:43.360" style="s2">things to do. Sasha has more good news.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.920" end="00:02:44.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, after 2 months of hard work, I</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.360" end="00:02:46.080" style="s2">finally closed the Helix digital asset</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.959" end="00:02:47.280" style="s2">project that&#39;s been straddled for 5</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.080" end="00:02:48.640" style="s2">years. This is going to be Reed&#39;s next</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.280" end="00:02:49.840" style="s2">core asset. I brought you all here today</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.640" end="00:02:51.280" style="s2">to celebrate early. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.840" end="00:02:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha, you&#39;re incredible. You closed the</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.280" end="00:02:54.800" style="s2">deal like that? Yeah, Sasha&#39;s the real</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.720" end="00:02:57.840" style="s2">MVP. Without her, Reed Group wouldn&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.800" end="00:03:00.400" style="s2">where it is today. What&#39;s so funny?</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.840" end="00:03:02.080" style="s2">Not you. You&#39;re doing it on purpose. A</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.400" end="00:03:03.840" style="s2">clueless woman like you laughing at</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.080" end="00:03:05.680" style="s2">other people. No wonder Chase can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.840" end="00:03:07.920" style="s2">stand you. You know why that project&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.680" end="00:03:09.519" style="s2">been stalled for 5 years? Because for 5</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.920" end="00:03:12.519" style="s2">years, nobody was dumb enough to take</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.519" end="00:03:12.519" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.959" end="00:03:16.959" style="s2">What do you know? That platform went</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.040" end="00:03:18.480" style="s2">through three investors. Each one pulled</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.959" end="00:03:22.400" style="s2">out in under a month. They can&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.480" end="00:03:24.080" style="s2">cover next month&#39;s operating costs.</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.400" end="00:03:26.879" style="s2">Sasha, you didn&#39;t even do basic due</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.080" end="00:03:29.040" style="s2">diligence, did you? Looks like I hit a</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.879" end="00:03:30.720" style="s2">nerve. Chase is going to end up bankrupt</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.040" end="00:03:33.280" style="s2">because of you. You&#39;re dumber than a</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.720" end="00:03:35.680" style="s2">pig.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.280" end="00:03:37.440" style="s2">Ivy, you&#39;re nothing but dead weight</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.680" end="00:03:38.879" style="s2">coasting on your engagement to Chase.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.440" end="00:03:41.360" style="s2">And you think you can laugh at me in</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.879" end="00:03:44.159" style="s2">public? I&#39;ll put you in your place right</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.360" end="00:03:46.640" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.159" end="00:03:47.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, that was out of line. Apologize to</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.640" end="00:03:52.720" style="s2">Sasha now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.920" end="00:03:54.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologize to her. She&#39;s not worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.720" end="00:03:57.599" style="s2">Dad, you heard that? This is the fiance</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.879" end="00:03:58.959" style="s2">you picked for me. Dad, it&#39;s the 21st</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.599" end="00:03:59.680" style="s2">century. You can&#39;t force me into an</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.959" end="00:04:01.120" style="s2">arranged marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.680" end="00:04:03.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 20 years ago, when the Cain family was</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.120" end="00:04:04.799" style="s2">at its lowest, Chase&#39;s father helped us.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.120" end="00:04:05.760" style="s2">That debt has to be repaid.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.799" end="00:04:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you [snorts] want to repay him so</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.760" end="00:04:07.200" style="s2">badly, why don&#39;t you marry his son</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.720" end="00:04:08.720" style="s2">yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.200" end="00:04:08.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smart mouth. Just do this one thing for</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.720" end="00:04:10.239" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.959" end="00:04:12.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I pick my own man.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.239" end="00:04:14.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is already decided. No arguments.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.879" end="00:04:16.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Push me again and I&#39;ll cut.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.239" end="00:04:17.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead. We have a top medical team on</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.000" end="00:04:19.120" style="s2">standby 24/7. You could cut through an</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.840" end="00:04:20.320" style="s2">artery and you still wouldn&#39;t die. You</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.120" end="00:04:20.959" style="s2">just lose some blood and it would hurt</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.320" end="00:04:22.400" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.959" end="00:04:24.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I even your real daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.400" end="00:04:27.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. You&#39;re my daughter. I&#39;d never</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.080" end="00:04:27.240" style="s2">hurt you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.160" end="00:04:32.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your fianceé. Well, satisfied.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.440" end="00:04:33.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you just show me the picture</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.800" end="00:04:35.040" style="s2">first?</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.360" end="00:04:36.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go spend some time with Chase and his</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.040" end="00:04:39.400" style="s2">company&#39;s struggling right now. Help him</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.400" end="00:04:39.400" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.120" end="00:04:45.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the past year, I&#39;ve quietly brought</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.880" end="00:04:47.040" style="s2">in over a dozen major clients for Chase.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.360" end="00:04:49.199" style="s2">That&#39;s the only reason Reed Group turned</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.040" end="00:04:50.880" style="s2">things around. And what do I get? All</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.199" end="00:04:53.759" style="s2">the credit goes to Sasha, who does</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.880" end="00:04:55.759" style="s2">nothing but lie and take credit. Dad, I</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.759" end="00:04:59.160" style="s2">like a good-look guy as much as anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.759" end="00:04:59.160" style="s2">But I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.560" end="00:05:04.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did she really mean that thing about the</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.000" end="00:05:05.919" style="s2">project? What if she&#39;s right?</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.080" end="00:05:07.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. She can&#39;t even read a financial</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.919" end="00:05:09.280" style="s2">report. You think she can spot a bad</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.280" end="00:05:10.880" style="s2">deal? She&#39;s just jealous of Sasha. Got a</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.280" end="00:05:12.160" style="s2">nasty streak. No wonder Chase can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.880" end="00:05:14.880" style="s2">stand her.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.160" end="00:05:16.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow, that hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.880" end="00:05:18.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, I&#39;m giving you one more chance.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.240" end="00:05:19.919" style="s2">Let&#39;s apologize to Sasha now.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.240" end="00:05:20.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should I kneel down so she can slap me a</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.919" end="00:05:22.000" style="s2">few times, too?</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.639" end="00:05:23.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re really sincere, I&#39;ll throw you</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.000" end="00:05:24.880" style="s2">another engagement party, but whether we</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.680" end="00:05:25.680" style="s2">actually get married depends on your</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.880" end="00:05:27.680" style="s2">behavior.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.680" end="00:05:29.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if I don&#39;t apologize,</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.680" end="00:05:31.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; then I&#39;m calling off the engagement.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.919" end="00:05:33.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure you won&#39;t regret that?</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.440" end="00:05:35.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drop the act. I know you&#39;d do anything</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.199" end="00:05:36.560" style="s2">to marry me. Too bad a crude woman like</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.280" end="00:05:38.160" style="s2">you doesn&#39;t deserve me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.560" end="00:05:39.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard him. Chase doesn&#39;t want you</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.160" end="00:05:41.600" style="s2">anymore. Why are you still here?</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.680" end="00:05:43.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, get lost. You&#39;re ruining the vibe.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.600" end="00:05:44.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calling off the engagement isn&#39;t up to</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.120" end="00:05:46.320" style="s2">him. My father has to agree.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.880" end="00:05:46.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please. You think your dad&#39;s somebody</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.320" end="00:05:49.520" style="s2">important?</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.880" end="00:05:52.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, if you don&#39;t leave right now, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.520" end="00:05:55.320" style="s2">blame me for what happens next. You dare</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.000" end="00:05:55.320" style="s2">ignore me?</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.000" end="00:06:02.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My earring. Chase gave me that.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.960" end="00:06:06.080" style="s2">Chase gave me that. That was a birthday</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.800" end="00:06:08.160" style="s2">gift from Chase. It&#39;s worth a h 100red</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.080" end="00:06:08.960" style="s2">grand. I didn&#39;t throw you in the ocean.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.160" end="00:06:09.919" style="s2">That&#39;s mercy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.960" end="00:06:11.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been patient with you because</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.919" end="00:06:12.800" style="s2">you&#39;re my fiance. Now get out of my</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.360" end="00:06:13.520" style="s2">sight. Don&#39;t make me do something we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.800" end="00:06:15.039" style="s2">both regret.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.520" end="00:06:17.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, you&#39;re too easy on her. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.039" end="00:06:19.120" style="s2">why she keeps pushing. Two choices. Pay</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.440" end="00:06:22.000" style="s2">me a million or get on your knees and</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.120" end="00:06:23.680" style="s2">let me slap you until I&#39;m satisfied.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.000" end="00:06:25.840" style="s2">A 100,000 earring and you want a</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.680" end="00:06:27.440" style="s2">million. Sasha, you&#39;re out of your mind.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.840" end="00:06:29.120" style="s2">Chase gave me that necklace. His</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.440" end="00:06:30.560" style="s2">feelings for me are priceless. A woman</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.120" end="00:06:31.919" style="s2">like you wouldn&#39;t understand. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.560" end="00:06:32.639" style="s2">right. That necklace means something.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.919" end="00:06:33.600" style="s2">It&#39;s generous.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.639" end="00:06:34.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just jealous. That&#39;s why you</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.600" end="00:06:36.479" style="s2">threw it in the ocean.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.400" end="00:06:38.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, you feel the same way.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.479" end="00:06:40.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you hadn&#39;t come after Sasha, none of</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.160" end="00:06:41.759" style="s2">this would have happened. Just pay. She</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.160" end="00:06:42.800" style="s2">can&#39;t even afford decent clothes. No way</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.759" end="00:06:43.199" style="s2">she has a million. Just get on your</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.800" end="00:06:44.560" style="s2">knees.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.199" end="00:06:46.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe she does have a million. Didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.560" end="00:06:48.400" style="s2">she say this island belongs to her? A</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.639" end="00:06:50.034" style="s2">million&#39;s too cheap. It doesn&#39;t match</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.400" end="00:06:52.400" style="s2">Chase&#39;s feelings for you. I&#39;ll give you</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.034" end="00:06:54.720" style="s2">[music] 10 million. Are you insane? You</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.400" end="00:06:57.199" style="s2">don&#39;t have 10 million. You&#39;re right. I</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.720" end="00:07:00.600" style="s2">don&#39;t. [music] But he does.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.199" end="00:07:00.600" style="s2">Pay up fiance.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.440" end="00:07:05.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pay up fiance.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.440" end="00:07:06.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want money from me for what?</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.360" end="00:07:08.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my fiance. You can drop a h</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.960" end="00:07:10.479" style="s2">100red grand on a necklace for another</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.319" end="00:07:12.319" style="s2">woman. 10 million for me. Sounds fair.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.479" end="00:07:14.880" style="s2">Ivy, have some shame. You think you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.319" end="00:07:16.720" style="s2">on my level? Shut up. I&#39;m talking to my</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.880" end="00:07:18.319" style="s2">fianceé. You don&#39;t get a vote.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.720" end="00:07:20.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you can&#39;t pay, you take the</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.319" end="00:07:22.720" style="s2">punishment. Don&#39;t expect me to help you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.800" end="00:07:23.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Since you won&#39;t do this the</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.720" end="00:07:25.199" style="s2">easy way, I&#39;ll have to do it the hard</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.919" end="00:07:26.160" style="s2">way.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.199" end="00:07:27.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.160" end="00:07:29.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Reed Group had two transactions last</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.840" end="00:07:31.199" style="s2">month that won&#39;t survive an audit. I</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.520" end="00:07:32.800" style="s2">hand the evidence trail over to the EC.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.199" end="00:07:34.080" style="s2">They send a pina and your partners</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.800" end="00:07:34.479" style="s2">overnight. How long do you think you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.080" end="00:07:35.520" style="s2">last?</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.479" end="00:07:38.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How does she know about that?</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.520" end="00:07:41.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re bluffing, am I? You both know the</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.160" end="00:07:41.479" style="s2">answer to that.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.520" end="00:07:45.919" style="s2">Fine, [snorts] I&#39;ll pay.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.759" end="00:07:48.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 days, the money hits my account. Your</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.919" end="00:07:49.520" style="s2">business is settled. Now mine. You threw</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.160" end="00:07:51.599" style="s2">my phone in the ocean. You&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.520" end="00:07:52.960" style="s2">apologize? It&#39;s just a phone. You really</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.599" end="00:07:54.720" style="s2">going to make a thing out of this?</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.960" end="00:07:55.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s broke and desperate. Looking for a</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.720" end="00:07:57.280" style="s2">payout.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.919" end="00:07:59.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When she was shaking me down, I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.280" end="00:08:02.240" style="s2">see any of you stepping in. This isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.599" end="00:08:03.680" style="s2">just a phone. Apologize now or you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.240" end="00:08:05.199" style="s2">wish you had. You think you can scare</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.680" end="00:08:06.479" style="s2">me? If that phone is really so</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.199" end="00:08:09.520" style="s2">important, I&#39;ll kneel down and slap</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.479" end="00:08:13.479" style="s2">myself. You said it. Don&#39;t back out.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.520" end="00:08:13.479" style="s2">Two, one.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.199" end="00:08:27.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s That&#39;s the Lion Guard insignia.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.680" end="00:08:29.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the top security team in Miami.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.280" end="00:08:32.080" style="s2">One call out costs a fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.919" end="00:08:33.680" style="s2">Miss Kane, we detected an anomaly with</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.080" end="00:08:35.919" style="s2">your phone signal and came immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.680" end="00:08:37.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. Who Who the hell are you? You</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.919" end="00:08:39.039" style="s2">don&#39;t get to know. Now, honor your</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.360" end="00:08:40.000" style="s2">promise. Are you slapping yourself or</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.039" end="00:08:41.360" style="s2">should they do it for you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.000" end="00:08:42.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t. If you lay a hand on me, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.360" end="00:08:43.680" style="s2">call the police.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.000" end="00:08:45.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, the phone you destroyed has a</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.680" end="00:08:46.880" style="s2">global tracking device. Any anomaly</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.360" end="00:08:49.040" style="s2">triggers our security system. This</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.880" end="00:08:51.120" style="s2">operation cost 50 million. Settle it now</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.040" end="00:08:52.800" style="s2">or we hand you over to the police.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.120" end="00:08:54.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, help me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.800" end="00:08:57.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, that&#39;s enough. You&#39;re just making</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.560" end="00:08:58.240" style="s2">me hate you more. 50 million? Fine. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.680" end="00:08:59.519" style="s2">pay.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.240" end="00:09:01.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll drop that kind of money on her</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.519" end="00:09:03.120" style="s2">just like that? Chase, you really are</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.120" end="00:09:04.480" style="s2">devoted. Fine, I&#39;ll give you the chance.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.120" end="00:09:05.680" style="s2">3 days. Money in my account.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.480" end="00:09:06.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need for 3 days. I&#39;ll transfer it</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.680" end="00:09:07.519" style="s2">now. But on one condition, we end the</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.959" end="00:09:09.440" style="s2">engagement now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.519" end="00:09:10.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, I&#39;m asking you one last time. You</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.440" end="00:09:13.800" style="s2">sure you won&#39;t regret this?</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.560" end="00:09:13.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sure.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.399" end="00:09:19.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 50 million&#39;s in your account. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.600" end="00:09:19.800" style="s2">done. Don&#39;t ever let me see you again.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.600" end="00:09:28.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.480" end="00:09:29.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, you just transferred 50 million</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.399" end="00:09:30.640" style="s2">out of the company account. What&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.839" end="00:09:32.320" style="s2">on,</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.640" end="00:09:33.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad? The money went to Ivy. She&#39;s out of</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.320" end="00:09:36.160" style="s2">control. I&#39;m done. I&#39;m ending the</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.920" end="00:09:38.160" style="s2">engagement. ending the engagement. Are</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.160" end="00:09:39.920" style="s2">you insane? I&#39;m telling you right now,</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.160" end="00:09:42.560" style="s2">you do this and I&#39;m cutting you off.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.920" end="00:09:44.640" style="s2">Even if you do, I&#39;m not backing down.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.560" end="00:09:46.240" style="s2">I&#39;m marrying a woman like Sasha. Someone</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.640" end="00:09:48.880" style="s2">with real ability. Someone who can build</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.240" end="00:09:50.399" style="s2">with me, not a worthless nobody. You</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.880" end="00:09:51.680" style="s2">idiot. Do you even know who&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.399" end="00:09:54.480" style="s2">helping you all these years?</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.680" end="00:09:56.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha, obviously. Dad, don&#39;t tell me</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.480" end="00:09:59.120" style="s2">you&#39;re going to say it was Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.640" end="00:10:00.800" style="s2">She&#39;s useless. Besides cooking and</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.120" end="00:10:04.000" style="s2">cleaning, what has she ever done for me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.800" end="00:10:05.760" style="s2">How did I raise an idiot like you? Ivy,</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.000" end="00:10:06.720" style="s2">I know you&#39;re there. I failed as a</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.760" end="00:10:08.080" style="s2">father. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.720" end="00:10:09.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reed, you don&#39;t have to apologize</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.080" end="00:10:10.800" style="s2">for him. He and I are done.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.519" end="00:10:12.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, can you do this for me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.800" end="00:10:14.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reed, I gave him plenty of chances.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.320" end="00:10:17.120" style="s2">He never appreciated any of them.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.399" end="00:10:18.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase doesn&#39;t deserve you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.120" end="00:10:20.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, even if you do have connections, I</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.800" end="00:10:21.600" style="s2">don&#39;t care. Everything I have, I built</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.320" end="00:10:23.200" style="s2">myself. I don&#39;t need anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.600" end="00:10:24.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What connections could she have? She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.200" end="00:10:26.880" style="s2">just coasting on Mr. Reed&#39;s favoritism</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.800" end="00:10:28.240" style="s2">to get your attention. She&#39;s all talk.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.880" end="00:10:28.880" style="s2">If she&#39;s really an Iris, then I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.240" end="00:10:30.160" style="s2">next president.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.880" end="00:10:31.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get lost. You&#39;re keeping us from meeting</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.160" end="00:10:33.120" style="s2">Miss Kane. And once we lock in the</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.279" end="00:10:36.160" style="s2">partnership, our valuation triples.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.120" end="00:10:37.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too bad. The partnership&#39;s off. Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.160" end="00:10:38.880" style="s2">You&#39;re just jealous. You&#39;ve been chasing</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.600" end="00:10:39.360" style="s2">Chase for a year, and he won&#39;t even look</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.880" end="00:10:41.120" style="s2">at you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.360" end="00:10:42.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get lost. Regroup&#39;s about to hit the</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.120" end="00:10:43.920" style="s2">top. You&#39;ll spend your whole life</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.160" end="00:10:45.440" style="s2">looking up at us. Ivory, you really are</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.920" end="00:10:46.399" style="s2">vicious. Just because I called off the</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.440" end="00:10:47.600" style="s2">engagement, you&#39;re jinxing my</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.399" end="00:10:49.680" style="s2">partnership. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.600" end="00:10:51.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase net worth is about to skyrocket.</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.680" end="00:10:54.120" style="s2">Too bad he&#39;ll never want someone like</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.120" end="00:10:54.120" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.800" end="00:10:58.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See that? That&#39;s the Kane family</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.399" end="00:10:59.839" style="s2">helicopter. The Cane Air is coming in</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.320" end="00:11:01.519" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.839" end="00:11:02.880" style="s2">That&#39;s Stone, Mr. Kane&#39;s personal</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.519" end="00:11:04.640" style="s2">assistant. Looks like he&#39;s here with</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.880" end="00:11:06.000" style="s2">Miss Kane to sign the contract. Finally,</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.640" end="00:11:07.440" style="s2">we get to see the Kane air.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.000" end="00:11:09.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, didn&#39;t you say the partnership&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.440" end="00:11:10.720" style="s2">off? Miss Kane&#39;s here in person. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.360" end="00:11:13.360" style="s2">you feel ridiculous?</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.720" end="00:11:15.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Regret it? Too late. Small-minded and</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.360" end="00:11:17.120" style="s2">jealous. That&#39;s why Chase dumped you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.200" end="00:11:18.480" style="s2">Once we sign with Miss Kane, Chase will</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.120" end="00:11:21.880" style="s2">be at the top and you&#39;ll be looking up</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.480" end="00:11:21.880" style="s2">from the governor.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.320" end="00:11:24.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Stone, good to meet you. Where&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.760" end="00:11:25.519" style="s2">Miss Kane? Why doesn&#39;t she come off the</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.959" end="00:11:28.640" style="s2">helicopter?</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.519" end="00:11:32.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Kane is right here. Miss Kane. Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.640" end="00:11:34.160" style="s2">Kane sent me to bring you home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.320" end="00:11:34.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stone is treating Iivevy like royalty.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.160" end="00:11:36.480" style="s2">Who is she?</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.880" end="00:11:38.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she the Cane heir?</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.480" end="00:11:40.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.079" end="00:11:43.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Figure it out. Oh, and I left you a</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.000" end="00:11:43.480" style="s2">surprise. Enjoy.</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.160" end="00:11:46.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re screwed. She really is the cane</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.560" end="00:11:48.240" style="s2">heir.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.959" end="00:11:49.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We crossed her. Is she going to come</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.240" end="00:11:52.920" style="s2">after us? The canes could crush us like</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.920" end="00:11:52.920" style="s2">ants.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.000" end="00:12:00.240" style="s2">Damn it. Reed&#39;s stock is tanking. That</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.560" end="00:12:01.680" style="s2">psycho Ivy did this.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.240" end="00:12:04.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. She doesn&#39;t have that kind of</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.680" end="00:12:04.680" style="s2">power.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.680" end="00:12:08.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, relax. I&#39;ve got this. I had</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.440" end="00:12:09.920" style="s2">partners lining up to work with me. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.800" end="00:12:11.200" style="s2">call them right now. We&#39;ll get through</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.920" end="00:12:12.560" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.200" end="00:12:14.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jack, it&#39;s Sasha from Reed Group.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.560" end="00:12:16.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a joke. Don&#39;t ever call me again.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.320" end="00:12:16.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? That&#39;s a mistake. Hank, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.320" end="00:12:18.880" style="s2">Sasha.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.880" end="00:12:20.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha, you&#39;ve got some nerve calling me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.880" end="00:12:23.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They didn&#39;t talk to me like that before.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.959" end="00:12:26.240" style="s2">What changed?</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.040" end="00:12:28.160" style="s2">No, I don&#39;t believe it. Grant, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.240" end="00:12:31.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha. Who the hell are you? Don&#39;t waste</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.160" end="00:12:31.399" style="s2">my time.</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.040" end="00:12:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, we&#39;ve got a problem. The banks</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.800" end="00:12:37.600" style="s2">just froze all our loans, and they want</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.000" end="00:12:39.839" style="s2">repayment in 3 days.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.600" end="00:12:41.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? It gets worse. Every partner Sasha</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.839" end="00:12:42.399" style="s2">signed last year pulled out and tore up</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.120" end="00:12:44.000" style="s2">their contracts. Even our long-term</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.399" end="00:12:45.279" style="s2">suppliers are terminating. At this rate,</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.000" end="00:12:47.120" style="s2">we&#39;re bankrupt in a month.</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.279" end="00:12:50.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Figure it out. Oh, and I left you a</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.120" end="00:12:50.680" style="s2">surprise. Enjoy.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.040" end="00:12:59.440" style="s2">Ivy, what did you do? This is your</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.560" end="00:13:01.120" style="s2">surprise.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.440" end="00:13:03.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A year ago, your company was about to go</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.120" end="00:13:04.959" style="s2">under. I quietly brought in over a dozen</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.200" end="00:13:06.240" style="s2">major clients for you. Now that the</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.959" end="00:13:07.839" style="s2">engagement&#39;s off, I&#39;m just letting</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.240" end="00:13:10.800" style="s2">things go back to how they were. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.839" end="00:13:12.560" style="s2">even.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.800" end="00:13:13.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Kane, Mr. Kane sent me to bring you</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.560" end="00:13:18.279" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.839" end="00:13:18.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, she really is the cane hair.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.399" end="00:13:25.839" style="s2">No way. She&#39;s so crude. How could she be</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.880" end="00:13:27.360" style="s2">the Cane heir?</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.839" end="00:13:30.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then how do you explain Stone calling</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.360" end="00:13:30.839" style="s2">her Mrs. Kain?</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.680" end="00:13:34.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because she&#39;s the Kane family head&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.920" end="00:13:35.760" style="s2">mistress.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.800" end="00:13:37.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.760" end="00:13:39.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is it impossible? I heard these top</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.600" end="00:13:39.920" style="s2">families keep women on the side. When</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.040" end="00:13:41.760" style="s2">they bring them out, they call them</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.920" end="00:13:42.880" style="s2">their adopted daughters. Sasha&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.760" end="00:13:44.639" style="s2">I&#39;ve heard Vincent Kane has a</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.880" end="00:13:46.320" style="s2">reputation. Keeps a bunch of mistresses.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.639" end="00:13:47.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, too. Those women call themselves</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.320" end="00:13:49.519" style="s2">Mrs. Kane in public, but they&#39;re just</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.760" end="00:13:51.200" style="s2">the family head side pieces. That</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.519" end="00:13:52.800" style="s2">explains everything. Ivy must have</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.200" end="00:13:55.360" style="s2">latched onto Vincent Kane recently.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.800" end="00:13:56.959" style="s2">That&#39;s why she&#39;s suddenly so cocky. What</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.360" end="00:13:58.399" style="s2">you&#39;re saying makes some sense, but</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.959" end="00:13:59.680" style="s2">until we know for sure, we don&#39;t jump to</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.399" end="00:14:01.360" style="s2">conclusions.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.680" end="00:14:02.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I actually ran into Leo at an industry</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.360" end="00:14:04.560" style="s2">event last month. He&#39;s close with the</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.880" end="00:14:07.120" style="s2">Cain family. He&#39;d know the truth about</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.560" end="00:14:09.199" style="s2">Ivy. Leo&#39;s the new money in Miami</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.120" end="00:14:11.279" style="s2">Finance. Net worth in the hundreds of</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.199" end="00:14:13.519" style="s2">billions. If Reed Group goes under,</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.279" end="00:14:17.600" style="s2">Chase might not recover. I need a backup</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.519" end="00:14:17.600" style="s2">plan. Leo&#39;s a good option.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.120" end="00:14:25.040" style="s2">Leo, I don&#39;t get it. Looks, family,</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.519" end="00:14:26.880" style="s2">ability. You beat Chase in every</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.040" end="00:14:28.639" style="s2">category. Why does Ivy pick him? She</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.880" end="00:14:30.240" style="s2">even helped him steal clients from us.</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.639" end="00:14:31.680" style="s2">That&#39;s how people are. You drive a super</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.240" end="00:14:32.639" style="s2">car long enough, sometimes a bicycle</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.680" end="00:14:34.320" style="s2">feels exciting.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.639" end="00:14:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo&#39;s playing backup and he&#39;s still this</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.320" end="00:14:38.600" style="s2">confident about it. I&#39;ve seen</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.600" end="00:14:38.600" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.079" end="00:14:45.000" style="s2">Leo, [snorts] big news. Check Ivy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.000" end="00:14:45.000" style="s2">post.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.160" end="00:14:54.085" style="s2">IVY&#39;S THE GOAT.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.360" end="00:14:56.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WE LOVE YOU, IVY.</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.085" end="00:14:56.105" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.760" end="00:15:01.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A single party. Iivey&#39;s really single.</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.240" end="00:15:03.360" style="s2">Confirmed. The engagement between Ivy</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.920" end="00:15:05.360" style="s2">and Chase is officially terminated.</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.360" end="00:15:07.040" style="s2">Finally. I&#39;ve been waiting for this day.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.360" end="00:15:08.800" style="s2">Word is Chase never even knew who she</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.040" end="00:15:10.320" style="s2">really was. What an idiot. Thank god</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.800" end="00:15:12.480" style="s2">he&#39;s an idiot. Otherwise, I&#39;d never have</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.320" end="00:15:14.320" style="s2">a shot. Leo, I&#39;ll arrange a private jet.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.480" end="00:15:14.800" style="s2">get you to Ivy as fast as possible. Hold</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.320" end="00:15:17.040" style="s2">off,</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.800" end="00:15:18.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo. Now&#39;s not the time to play it cool.</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.040" end="00:15:20.000" style="s2">This window won&#39;t stay open.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.959" end="00:15:23.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve never even been in a</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.000" end="00:15:25.680" style="s2">relationship. You&#39;re giving me advice.</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.440" end="00:15:27.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet. Before I see Ivy, I&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.680" end="00:15:29.440" style="s2">something important to handle. Time to</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.600" end="00:15:32.440" style="s2">pay that idiot a visit. Settle some</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.440" end="00:15:32.440" style="s2">scores.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.399" end="00:15:37.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, what a coincidence. Didn&#39;t expect</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.160" end="00:15:39.760" style="s2">to run into you here.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.199" end="00:15:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Leo. I&#39;ve heard a lot about you.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.760" end="00:15:42.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes,</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.480" end="00:15:44.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase. I&#39;ve heard a lot about you, too.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.480" end="00:15:46.399" style="s2">None of it good. What&#39;s that supposed to</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.959" end="00:15:47.920" style="s2">mean? You just called off your</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.399" end="00:15:49.600" style="s2">engagement and not even a week later,</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.920" end="00:15:51.120" style="s2">you&#39;re cozy with your secretary. Word is</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.600" end="00:15:52.800" style="s2">you two have been together for a while.</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.120" end="00:15:54.560" style="s2">Guess it&#39;s true. You&#39;re way too</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.800" end="00:15:56.320" style="s2">interested in my personal life. So, the</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.560" end="00:15:58.079" style="s2">rumors are true. Chase, you can&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.320" end="00:15:58.959" style="s2">tell Glass from Diamond. Maybe get your</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.079" end="00:16:00.720" style="s2">head checked.</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.959" end="00:16:04.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, there&#39;s a Luca piece over there.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.720" end="00:16:05.920" style="s2">Let&#39;s go take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.240" end="00:16:08.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These sapphire earrings are designed by</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.920" end="00:16:10.160" style="s2">the legendary jeweler Luca. The reserve</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.000" end="00:16:12.000" style="s2">is 1 million. Those look just like the</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.160" end="00:16:13.996" style="s2">earrings Ivy threw into the ocean.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.000" end="00:16:14.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you like them, I&#39;ll buy them for you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.996" end="00:16:16.560" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.079" end="00:16:18.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, thank you. You&#39;re so good to me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.560" end="00:16:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 1 million. I&#39;ll take them. 2 million. 2</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.880" end="00:16:21.680" style="s2">million and 10,000.</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.000" end="00:16:23.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo&#39;s only bidding one increment higher.</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.680" end="00:16:24.079" style="s2">He&#39;s messing with Chase on purpose. This</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.279" end="00:16:26.959" style="s2">is going to be good.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.079" end="00:16:28.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 19 million and 10,000. 20 million. Since</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.959" end="00:16:29.519" style="s2">Chase wants them so badly, I&#39;ll let him</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.959" end="00:16:31.279" style="s2">have them.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.519" end="00:16:35.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, Chase. The earrings are</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.279" end="00:16:35.000" style="s2">yours for 20 million.</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.759" end="00:16:39.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, wait up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.440" end="00:16:48.320" style="s2">Leo, wait up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.360" end="00:16:49.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need something?</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.320" end="00:16:51.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, Chase didn&#39;t mean to go up against</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.680" end="00:16:53.680" style="s2">you back there. I&#39;m apologizing for him.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.759" end="00:16:55.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re apologizing for him? Sasha,</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.680" end="00:16:56.480" style="s2">you&#39;re already playing Mrs. Reed. Push</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.040" end="00:16:57.440" style="s2">out Chase&#39;s fianceé. Take her spot.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.480" end="00:16:59.279" style="s2">That&#39;s a hell of a move.</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.440" end="00:17:00.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, you&#39;ve got it all wrong. Chase</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.279" end="00:17:02.480" style="s2">ended the engagement. That had nothing</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.720" end="00:17:04.000" style="s2">to do with me. It was Ivy&#39;s problem.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.480" end="00:17:06.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, how so?</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.000" end="00:17:09.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Iivey&#39;s personal life isn&#39;t exactly</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.559" end="00:17:09.199" style="s2">clean.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.559" end="00:17:13.919" style="s2">Who told you that?</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.079" end="00:17:15.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, you&#39;re close with the Cain family.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.919" end="00:17:17.280" style="s2">You must know about the family head.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.600" end="00:17:19.360" style="s2">There are rumors that Ivy and him are</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.280" end="00:17:21.039" style="s2">involved. Is that true?</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.360" end="00:17:22.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a pretty private matter. Who&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.039" end="00:17:24.559" style="s2">you hear it from?</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.400" end="00:17:26.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, my guess was right.</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.559" end="00:17:27.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch what you say. You might get</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.400" end="00:17:31.079" style="s2">yourself in trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.600" end="00:17:31.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks for the warning.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.160" end="00:17:37.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, you humiliated me. This isn&#39;t over.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.960" end="00:17:41.679" style="s2">Leo, weren&#39;t you here to pick out a gift</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.240" end="00:17:43.360" style="s2">for Ivy? Why&#39;d you let Chase take the</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.679" end="00:17:45.280" style="s2">necklace? A million dollar piece going</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.360" end="00:17:46.799" style="s2">for 20 million. Whoever buys it is an</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.280" end="00:17:48.880" style="s2">idiot. Besides, that necklace isn&#39;t good</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.799" end="00:17:50.960" style="s2">enough for Ivy. She deserves the best.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.880" end="00:17:53.039" style="s2">Leo, that was smooth. I&#39;m not just</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.960" end="00:17:54.880" style="s2">making Chase overpay. I&#39;m putting him in</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.039" end="00:17:56.832" style="s2">the news. Got it. I&#39;ll call the media.</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.880" end="00:17:58.799" style="s2">He&#39;ll be on every front page tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.832" end="00:18:04.039" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.799" end="00:18:04.039" style="s2">Soon, Ivy will see each other very soon.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.480" end="00:18:17.120" style="s2">That little punk. He&#39;s slapping the Cane</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.320" end="00:18:18.240" style="s2">family in the face. His son pulls a</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.120" end="00:18:18.960" style="s2">stunt like that and he thinks he can</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.240" end="00:18:20.960" style="s2">call me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.960" end="00:18:22.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, don&#39;t get worked up. He&#39;s not worth</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.960" end="00:18:23.679" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.080" end="00:18:24.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, I&#39;m sorry I put you through that.</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.679" end="00:18:25.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, how are you going to make it up to</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.880" end="00:18:26.320" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.200" end="00:18:27.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, I&#39;m staying out of your</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.320" end="00:18:28.880" style="s2">love life. Whoever you choose, I</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.760" end="00:18:33.559" style="s2">support.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.880" end="00:18:33.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? That&#39;s the best. Love you, Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.039" end="00:18:40.799" style="s2">Ivy, the second I heard you were single,</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.799" end="00:18:42.480" style="s2">I threw this party. Pretty good, right?</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.799" end="00:18:43.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. We were never together.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.480" end="00:18:44.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Yeah. That guy&#39;s an idiot. He</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.840" end="00:18:45.760" style="s2">didn&#39;t deserve you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.559" end="00:18:46.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re all together. Let&#39;s not talk about</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.760" end="00:18:48.799" style="s2">that loser.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.640" end="00:18:51.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, you&#39;re single now. How about giving</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.799" end="00:18:52.799" style="s2">me a shot? Ivy, me, too. I&#39;m serious</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.280" end="00:18:54.559" style="s2">about you. All right, everyone, back</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.799" end="00:18:55.840" style="s2">off. Someone&#39;s been into Ivy for years.</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.559" end="00:18:56.799" style="s2">You two don&#39;t stand a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.840" end="00:19:01.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who? Spit it out.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.799" end="00:19:06.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, who&#39;s trying to steal Ivy from me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.039" end="00:19:06.280" style="s2">Speak of the devil. I&#39;m at the stables.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.480" end="00:19:12.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure the Canair is coming today?</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.320" end="00:19:14.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. My source is solid. Once we meet</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.640" end="00:19:16.799" style="s2">her and expose Iivey&#39;s lies, we get the</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.480" end="00:19:18.559" style="s2">partnership back. After we sign, Reed&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.799" end="00:19:20.160" style="s2">back from the dead. And Vincent Kane</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.559" end="00:19:22.240" style="s2">will see Ivy for what she really is.</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.160" end="00:19:24.000" style="s2">He&#39;ll toss her out like garbage.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.240" end="00:19:26.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, don&#39;t blame me. You brought this on</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.000" end="00:19:27.520" style="s2">yourself. I figured the Kane Air would</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.000" end="00:19:29.600" style="s2">be into piano, dancing, that kind of</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.520" end="00:19:31.679" style="s2">thing. But she&#39;s into horse racing.</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.600" end="00:19:33.520" style="s2">Proper ladies are boring. A woman with</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.679" end="00:19:35.039" style="s2">some fire, that&#39;s attractive.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.520" end="00:19:36.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucky for me, the Cane Air and I have</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.039" end="00:19:38.640" style="s2">the same hobby. I heard she races every</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.960" end="00:19:39.760" style="s2">week, so I signed up immediately. Had a</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.640" end="00:19:41.280" style="s2">horse flown in from Europe.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.760" end="00:19:42.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha&#39;s an incredible rider. You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.280" end="00:19:43.679" style="s2">place for sure.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.160" end="00:19:45.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to win. That&#39;s the only way to</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.679" end="00:19:47.360" style="s2">get the Canair&#39;s attention. Chase, just</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.679" end="00:19:49.440" style="s2">wait for good news.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.360" end="00:19:50.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pull this off, you&#39;re the MVP. Name</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.440" end="00:19:54.039" style="s2">your reward.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.720" end="00:19:54.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Chase.</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.039" end="00:20:01.280" style="s2">That build looks a lot like Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.840" end="00:20:03.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way she&#39;d be here. You&#39;re seeing</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.280" end="00:20:03.679" style="s2">things.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.120" end="00:20:05.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.679" end="00:20:07.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy&#39;s the type who sits at home all day.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.600" end="00:20:12.600" style="s2">She&#39;s never been on a horse in her life.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.760" end="00:20:12.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. I must be seeing things.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.440" end="00:20:16.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha, you look incredible up there. No</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.520" end="00:20:18.640" style="s2">wonder Chase fell for you the first time</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.640" end="00:20:20.480" style="s2">he saw you race. Knock it off.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.640" end="00:20:23.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase is blushing.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.480" end="00:20:25.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha on horseback. Yeah, that&#39;s a good</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.039" end="00:20:27.440" style="s2">look. Chase, thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.120" end="00:20:28.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Coat&#39;s got shine. Muscles are solid.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.440" end="00:20:29.600" style="s2">This horse is something else. Bet it</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.960" end="00:20:31.440" style="s2">wasn&#39;t cheap.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.600" end="00:20:32.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good eye, Nate. Purebred from Europe</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.440" end="00:20:33.840" style="s2">with shipping a million.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.960" end="00:20:35.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A million.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.840" end="00:20:37.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This horse won a G1. Worth way more than</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.840" end="00:20:39.520" style="s2">your average purebred.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.200" end="00:20:42.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A horse like this. I&#39;m learning things</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.520" end="00:20:42.520" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.960" end="00:20:48.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re like a bad smell. Can&#39;t get away</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.360" end="00:20:48.520" style="s2">from them.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.064" end="00:20:53.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.760" end="00:20:58.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SASHA&#39;S STILL IN THE LEAD. SHE&#39;S GOT</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.520" end="00:20:58.360" style="s2">THIS. LAST LAP. SASHA&#39;S GOT IT.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.320" end="00:21:08.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha fell. What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.960" end="00:21:10.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That winner must be the Cane Air.</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.960" end="00:21:12.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Top tier riding. No mistakes. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.720" end="00:21:16.240" style="s2">her. Miss Kane&#39;s reputation is well</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.640" end="00:21:19.679" style="s2">earned. Glad I got to see it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.240" end="00:21:22.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the Cane Air.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.679" end="00:21:23.120" style="s2">No way. The Cane Air wouldn&#39;t be riding</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.000" end="00:21:25.039" style="s2">some ordinary [snorts] mixed breed</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.120" end="00:21:27.679" style="s2">horse. The fact that I beat you proves</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.039" end="00:21:28.960" style="s2">it wasn&#39;t the horse. It&#39;s you. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.679" end="00:21:31.760" style="s2">just not good enough.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.960" end="00:21:34.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Kane, I&#39;m Chase Reed, CEO of Reed</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.760" end="00:21:34.760" style="s2">Group.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.679" end="00:21:43.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s you. How? She only knows how to</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.200" end="00:21:44.960" style="s2">cook and clean. When did she learn to</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.120" end="00:21:48.400" style="s2">ride? Does she have connections I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.960" end="00:21:50.799" style="s2">know about? Ivy, she can actually ride.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.400" end="00:21:53.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, how&#39;d you know I&#39;d be here? We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.799" end="00:21:54.240" style="s2">done. Why are you following me?</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.039" end="00:21:56.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What you&#39;re doing right now isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.240" end="00:21:57.679" style="s2">confidence. It&#39;s delusion. See a</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.240" end="00:22:00.679" style="s2">therapist.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.679" end="00:22:00.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.480" end="00:22:06.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on here? Who are you? Who I</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.039" end="00:22:10.159" style="s2">am is none of your business. Stay out of</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.799" end="00:22:13.120" style="s2">it. Big talk. You know whose place this</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.159" end="00:22:15.440" style="s2">is? Take your people and get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.120" end="00:22:17.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.440" end="00:22:19.679" style="s2">Ivy, you&#39;re nothing but Vincent Kane&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.760" end="00:22:21.360" style="s2">mistress. Stop acting like you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.679" end="00:22:24.080" style="s2">somebody. You think you&#39;re the Kane</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.360" end="00:22:25.840" style="s2">heir? [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.080" end="00:22:26.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, are these your clowns? They&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.840" end="00:22:29.360" style="s2">hilarious.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.880" end="00:22:31.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me introduce you. This is the CEO of</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.360" end="00:22:33.200" style="s2">Reed Group, my ex- fiance.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.760" end="00:22:36.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you&#39;re the idiot who got played by</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.200" end="00:22:38.400" style="s2">his secretary. You messed with Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.320" end="00:22:39.760" style="s2">You&#39;re going to pay. You piece of trash.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.400" end="00:22:40.400" style="s2">I&#39;m about to teach you a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.760" end="00:22:42.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t,</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.400" end="00:22:44.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy. After what he did to you,</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.960" end="00:22:46.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; not worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.480" end="00:22:47.760" style="s2">Besides, watching them make fools of</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.480" end="00:22:48.240" style="s2">themselves is better than beating them</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.760" end="00:22:51.520" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.240" end="00:22:53.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, drop the act. You were the one</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.520" end="00:22:55.840" style="s2">chasing me. A shameless woman like you,</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.840" end="00:22:59.159" style="s2">who&#39;d want you?</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.840" end="00:22:59.159" style="s2">I would.</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.080" end="00:23:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The main event is here. Showtime.</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.039" end="00:23:09.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo,</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.400" end="00:23:11.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you again.</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.760" end="00:23:13.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you always in my way?</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.919" end="00:23:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Simple. I don&#39;t like you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.919" end="00:23:17.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, you can&#39;t just pick up Chase&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.440" end="00:23:19.200" style="s2">leftovers. You know what she is.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.039" end="00:23:20.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. Who I want is none of your</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.200" end="00:23:22.720" style="s2">business.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.240" end="00:23:24.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, don&#39;t think being able to ride</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.720" end="00:23:26.480" style="s2">makes you special. I lost because you</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.960" end="00:23:28.240" style="s2">cheated.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.480" end="00:23:30.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I cheated.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.240" end="00:23:33.039" style="s2">Are you dreaming? Don&#39;t deny it. When I</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.880" end="00:23:35.039" style="s2">went over the last jump, you bumped me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.039" end="00:23:37.120" style="s2">My horse spooked and lost footing. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.039" end="00:23:39.760" style="s2">your fault. The whole race was on</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.120" end="00:23:41.760" style="s2">camera. You say I bumped you? Show the</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.760" end="00:23:43.840" style="s2">evidence. Stop making things up. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.760" end="00:23:48.159" style="s2">your fault. I would have won and met the</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.840" end="00:23:50.240" style="s2">cane heir all because of you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.159" end="00:23:52.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not letting this go. I want a</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.240" end="00:23:54.640" style="s2">rematch. I&#39;m going to take you down in</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.000" end="00:23:57.120" style="s2">front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.640" end="00:24:00.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you want to meet the canire? I know</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.120" end="00:24:03.600" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.080" end="00:24:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too bad she&#39;s not here.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.600" end="00:24:09.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy. You&#39;re going to need that later. I</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.720" end="00:24:13.520" style="s2">know the canire, too. Tell you what, you</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.679" end="00:24:14.640" style="s2">win the next one, I&#39;ll introduce you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.520" end="00:24:16.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.640" end="00:24:18.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, humor her. Ivy, you said it</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.960" end="00:24:20.960" style="s2">yourself. Watching clowns is fun. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.799" end="00:24:24.480" style="s2">not done watching.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.960" end="00:24:28.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, if that&#39;s what you want. My horse</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.480" end="00:24:33.080" style="s2">is hurt. No more riding. Something else.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.400" end="00:24:33.080" style="s2">Whatever you want. I&#39;m game.</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.080" end="00:24:38.559" style="s2">All three in the bullseye. Hell of a</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.919" end="00:24:40.559" style="s2">shot.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.559" end="00:24:44.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rapid fire and still that accurate.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.559" end="00:24:45.840" style="s2">She&#39;s clearly put in the hours.</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.320" end="00:24:47.760" style="s2">I trained under Eddie, the world</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.840" end="00:24:49.679" style="s2">shooting champion. Those three were just</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.760" end="00:24:51.760" style="s2">a warm-up.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.679" end="00:24:53.679" style="s2">You know Eddie</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.760" end="00:24:56.799" style="s2">jealous?</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.679" end="00:24:59.799" style="s2">Just just forfeit. Save yourself the</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.799" end="00:24:59.799" style="s2">embarrassment.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.200" end="00:25:05.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t know who&#39;s winning yet.</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.120" end="00:25:07.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People with no skill always talk big.</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.360" end="00:25:09.600" style="s2">Sasha really is the full package. Beauty</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.600" end="00:25:11.440" style="s2">and talent. No wonder Sasha keeps</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.600" end="00:25:13.600" style="s2">winning competitions. She trained under</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.440" end="00:25:14.880" style="s2">a world champion. Some local amateur</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.600" end="00:25:16.480" style="s2">competitions. That&#39;s what you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.880" end="00:25:18.960" style="s2">bragging about? She won them fair and</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.480" end="00:25:21.760" style="s2">square. What have you got? My best skill</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.960" end="00:25:24.559" style="s2">is standing next to Ivy.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.760" end="00:25:26.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Arguing is pointless. Whoever</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.559" end="00:25:28.640" style="s2">wins is what matters.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.000" end="00:25:30.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This round is pistol skip. 10 rounds</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.640" end="00:25:32.880" style="s2">each. Most hits win. It&#39;s one of the</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.960" end="00:25:35.200" style="s2">hardest shooting disciplines there is.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.880" end="00:25:37.360" style="s2">Real competitions use shotguns. With a</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.200" end="00:25:39.120" style="s2">pistol, even a top shooter like Eddie</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.360" end="00:25:42.600" style="s2">only hits six out of 10.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.120" end="00:25:42.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go first.</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.240" end="00:25:52.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many do you think she&#39;ll hit?</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.240" end="00:25:55.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Four. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.400" end="00:25:56.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One, two, three, four.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.039" end="00:26:00.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I hit four.</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.720" end="00:26:00.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Four. Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.039" end="00:26:09.600" style="s2">See that? That&#39;s skill. [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.000" end="00:26:11.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A discipline that hard and she hits</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.600" end="00:26:13.600" style="s2">four. Eddie student for sure. Sasha&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.440" end="00:26:15.200" style="s2">incredible. Sasha&#39;s exceptional. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.600" end="00:26:16.880" style="s2">professional level. That&#39;s what you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.200" end="00:26:19.120" style="s2">bragging about. Iivevy called four</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.880" end="00:26:20.240" style="s2">before she even shot. Not a single miss.</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.120" end="00:26:22.559" style="s2">That&#39;s real skill.</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.240" end="00:26:24.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucky guess. I could do that, too. I bet</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.559" end="00:26:28.480" style="s2">Ivy won&#39;t hit a single one. Oh, yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.880" end="00:26:29.679" style="s2">Keep your eyes open. Drop the act. A</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.480" end="00:26:31.360" style="s2">woman who sits at home cooking and</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.679" end="00:26:33.440" style="s2">cleaning. You can&#39;t even hold a gun.</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.360" end="00:26:35.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, I&#39;ll admit I underestimated you. I</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.440" end="00:26:36.799" style="s2">didn&#39;t know you could ride. But shooting</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.039" end="00:26:38.240" style="s2">takes talent. You can&#39;t beat Sasha.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.799" end="00:26:39.600" style="s2">Don&#39;t embarrass yourself. Even if you</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.240" end="00:26:40.880" style="s2">show off, I&#39;m not going to fall for you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.600" end="00:26:41.440" style="s2">You&#39;re the most shameless person I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.880" end="00:26:43.440" style="s2">ever met.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.440" end="00:26:46.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, don&#39;t flatter yourself. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.440" end="00:26:47.360" style="s2">interested in you. With a pistol, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.159" end="00:26:48.880" style="s2">all about predicting the target&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.360" end="00:26:52.760" style="s2">trajectory and timing your shot at the</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.880" end="00:26:52.760" style="s2">peak when it slows down.</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.200" end="00:26:57.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, that was incredible. First shot.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.760" end="00:26:58.880" style="s2">That timing. Even Eddie couldn&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.679" end="00:27:01.279" style="s2">that. She&#39;s unreal.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.880" end="00:27:05.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She can shoot, too. After you fire,</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.279" end="00:27:05.960" style="s2">reset your breathing. Stay sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.760" end="00:27:11.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last one.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.000" end="00:27:18.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. Even Eddie only hit six. She</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.720" end="00:27:21.039" style="s2">hit all 10. And the last one was a blind</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.880" end="00:27:25.520" style="s2">shot. Unbelievable. Ivy, that&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.039" end="00:27:27.360" style="s2">record. That&#39;s my girl. I mean, respect.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.520" end="00:27:29.120" style="s2">What&#39;s going on? Ivy was just a</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.360" end="00:27:30.720" style="s2">housewife. When did she learn to ride?</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.120" end="00:27:32.640" style="s2">When did she learn to shoot like that?</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.720" end="00:27:34.720" style="s2">Was I wrong about her this whole time?</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.640" end="00:27:36.799" style="s2">No, I don&#39;t misjudge people.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.720" end="00:27:39.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha, you said you trained under Eddie.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.799" end="00:27:43.799" style="s2">Does he know that? Of course. He</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.600" end="00:27:43.799" style="s2">personally coached me 3 days ago.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.080" end="00:27:48.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.640" end="00:27:51.120" style="s2">Eddie, long time no talk.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.400" end="00:27:53.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, what&#39;s up? You&#39;re a busy man.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.120" end="00:27:54.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just checking in. I heard you took on a</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.039" end="00:27:55.120" style="s2">pretty new student. Why didn&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.320" end="00:27:57.520" style="s2">introduce us?</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.120" end="00:28:00.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A student? I don&#39;t have any students.</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.520" end="00:28:01.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.159" end="00:28:04.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, when are you going to coach me</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.840" end="00:28:07.279" style="s2">again? Dinner&#39;s on me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.880" end="00:28:09.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eddie, how have you been?</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.279" end="00:28:11.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been training in Colorado Springs.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.600" end="00:28:13.520" style="s2">No time for students. Don&#39;t believe</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.840" end="00:28:16.080" style="s2">everything you hear.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.520" end="00:28:20.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hear that? Embarrassing, isn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.080" end="00:28:23.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You set this up. This video is fake. Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.159" end="00:28:23.880" style="s2">take a closer look.</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.960" end="00:28:31.279" style="s2">I&#39;ve seen him compete. That&#39;s Eddie.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.679" end="00:28:33.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got a photo with him. That video is</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.279" end="00:28:35.919" style="s2">real. Eddie, we&#39;ll be at your next</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.120" end="00:28:39.320" style="s2">match.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.919" end="00:28:39.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Appreciate it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.480" end="00:28:46.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, when exactly did I train you? I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.279" end="00:28:46.679" style="s2">love to hear this.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.799" end="00:28:50.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I watch study your match videos every</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.799" end="00:28:52.494" style="s2">day. I learned a lot from them. That</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.559" end="00:28:52.880" style="s2">makes me your student.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.494" end="00:28:54.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.880" end="00:28:56.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By that logic, everyone who&#39;s ever</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.640" end="00:28:59.044" style="s2">watched Eddie compete is his student.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.640" end="00:29:00.355" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eddie, your student body is global.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.044" end="00:29:01.039" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.355" end="00:29:02.559" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.039" end="00:29:04.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, don&#39;t start.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.559" end="00:29:06.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha, you&#39;re out here lying about being</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.720" end="00:29:09.440" style="s2">Eddie&#39;s student, trying to ruin his</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.559" end="00:29:10.880" style="s2">reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.440" end="00:29:12.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha, your behavior has damaged my</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.880" end="00:29:13.840" style="s2">reputation. You have one week to post a</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.320" end="00:29:17.080" style="s2">public apology video or my lawyers will</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.840" end="00:29:17.080" style="s2">be in touch.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.520" end="00:29:20.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lying about training under Eddie and</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.120" end="00:29:22.159" style="s2">still denying it, that tells you</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.399" end="00:29:23.919" style="s2">everything about her character. Once</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.159" end="00:29:25.520" style="s2">that apology video drops, her name&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.919" end="00:29:27.600" style="s2">done in the shooting world. She earned</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.520" end="00:29:29.760" style="s2">it. Ivy, on the other hand, has skill</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.600" end="00:29:31.279" style="s2">and integrity. Nothing but respect.</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.760" end="00:29:34.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could Sasha lie about something like</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.279" end="00:29:37.279" style="s2">that? That&#39;s insane.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.159" end="00:29:40.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, you got lucky. Next round, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.279" end="00:29:42.320" style="s2">win. You&#39;ve lost to me twice. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.159" end="00:29:44.000" style="s2">wasting any more time. Stop right there.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.320" end="00:29:45.360" style="s2">You&#39;re scared. You know you&#39;ll lose. Say</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.000" end="00:29:45.600" style="s2">whatever you want. That doesn&#39;t work on</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.360" end="00:29:47.360" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.600" end="00:29:48.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A competition with no stakes. Boring.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.360" end="00:29:51.440" style="s2">Why would anyone play?</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.320" end="00:29:53.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. A bet. Loser strips down and</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.440" end="00:29:56.360" style="s2">yells, &quot;I&#39;m trash.&quot; three times in front</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.200" end="00:29:56.360" style="s2">of everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.650" end="00:30:02.360" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.360" end="00:30:02.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.840" end="00:30:12.840" style="s2">Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.279" end="00:30:18.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My baby. How are you? Mommy&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.840" end="00:30:21.520" style="s2">Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.559" end="00:30:21.520" style="s2">be scared.</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.575" end="00:30:23.596" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.160" end="00:30:28.720" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.120" end="00:30:30.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.720" end="00:30:34.039" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.720" end="00:30:34.039" style="s2">Easy. Easy.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.039" end="00:30:41.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy&#39;s here. Don&#39;t be afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.200" end="00:30:43.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you people? You even dare attack</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.520" end="00:30:45.120" style="s2">the future son-in-law of America&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.200" end="00:30:46.960" style="s2">richest man? Do you know what happens</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.120" end="00:30:49.440" style="s2">when you cross the Carnegie family? And</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.960" end="00:30:50.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll make Ivy look like a fool. Hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.440" end="00:30:53.880" style="s2">Get her to the emergency room. Follow</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.880" end="00:30:53.880" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.399" end="00:30:57.399" style="s2">Hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.399" end="00:31:11.480" style="s2">I&#39;ve never lost a wine tasting. Someone</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.120" end="00:31:11.480" style="s2">at your level could never beat me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.799" end="00:31:35.760" style="s2">Bordeaux9s, Left Bank, Cabernet Blend,</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.080" end="00:31:37.600" style="s2">Margu. Am I right?</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.760" end="00:31:39.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly right. She got all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.600" end="00:31:41.519" style="s2">Sasha&#39;s a beast.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.200" end="00:31:43.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t even trying, but it&#39;s enough to</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.519" end="00:31:45.760" style="s2">beat her. Good.</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.519" end="00:31:47.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Told you tasting is my thing. Your turn.</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.760" end="00:31:49.120" style="s2">Let&#39;s see what you&#39;ve got.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.120" end="00:31:51.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smart. You say everything you can, so</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.120" end="00:31:53.279" style="s2">Ivy has to be more specific to win.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.120" end="00:31:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what? Nothing in the rules says I</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.279" end="00:31:57.120" style="s2">can&#39;t. Besides, you probably can&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.960" end="00:31:58.399" style="s2">name the grape. Playing games just shows</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.120" end="00:31:59.919" style="s2">you&#39;re scared.</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.399" end="00:32:02.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And even with a head start, you might</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.919" end="00:32:05.039" style="s2">still lose. You&#39;re just jealous.</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.480" end="00:32:06.960" style="s2">Ability, charm, talent. What do you have</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.039" end="00:32:10.960" style="s2">that I don&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.960" end="00:32:13.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, take my advice. Forfeit.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.960" end="00:32:14.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Losing to me. Nothing to be</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.600" end="00:32:16.720" style="s2">ashamed at.</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.960" end="00:32:19.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since we were engaged, I can put in a</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.720" end="00:32:21.360" style="s2">good word. Forfeit now. Better than</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.919" end="00:32:23.919" style="s2">embarrassing yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.360" end="00:32:25.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Funny. I don&#39;t forfeit.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.919" end="00:32:27.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, stop pretending to be the nice</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.519" end="00:32:28.720" style="s2">guy. The more you do it, the more</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.360" end="00:32:30.480" style="s2">disgusted I get.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.720" end="00:32:33.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m trying to help you and you throw it</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.480" end="00:32:34.720" style="s2">back in my face. Fine. Don&#39;t blame me</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.279" end="00:32:38.240" style="s2">when you lose.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.720" end="00:32:41.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll see. Someone&#39;s about to lose and</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.240" end="00:32:41.720" style="s2">it&#39;s not me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.440" end="00:32:50.399" style="s2">1996</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.960" end="00:32:53.039" style="s2">70% Cabernet 20 Merle 10 petiviver dier</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.399" end="00:32:55.279" style="s2">18 months in French oak black currant</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.039" end="00:32:57.440" style="s2">violet a hint of cedar and tobacco</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.279" end="00:33:00.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; that matches the winery records exactly</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.440" end="00:33:04.399" style="s2">that nose is unreal Ivy that was clean</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.559" end="00:33:06.320" style="s2">raised in a winery of course how how</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.399" end="00:33:08.320" style="s2">much about her do I not know</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.320" end="00:33:10.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; just by smelling it she named the year</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.320" end="00:33:12.320" style="s2">and the barrel that&#39;s not tasty ing.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.640" end="00:33:15.519" style="s2">That&#39;s witchcraft.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.320" end="00:33:17.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. You saw the label beforehand.</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.519" end="00:33:19.840" style="s2">You cheated.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.200" end="00:33:22.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open your eyes. Ivy never even touched</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.840" end="00:33:23.919" style="s2">the bottle. Say that again and see what</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.399" end="00:33:26.799" style="s2">happens.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.919" end="00:33:29.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not lying. How could anyone smell a</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.799" end="00:33:32.000" style="s2">wine and know all that?</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.440" end="00:33:34.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said you know wine. You&#39;ve never</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.000" end="00:33:37.279" style="s2">heard of aromatic analysis.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.399" end="00:33:39.760" style="s2">Don&#39;t give me that. It&#39;s the most basic</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.279" end="00:33:43.919" style="s2">part of tasting. Everything&#39;s in the</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.760" end="00:33:46.799" style="s2">nose. Anyone who knows wine can tell.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.919" end="00:33:48.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. You&#39;re a housewife. You can&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.799" end="00:33:50.799" style="s2">more about wine than me. I refuse to</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.880" end="00:33:53.039" style="s2">believe it. You think that little trick</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.799" end="00:33:55.600" style="s2">of yours is impressive? I was riding at</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.039" end="00:33:57.279" style="s2">8, shooting at 6:00. I grew up in a</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.600" end="00:34:00.000" style="s2">winery. Give me an empty glass. I can</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.279" end="00:34:01.519" style="s2">tell you what was poured in it. I got</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.000" end="00:34:02.960" style="s2">bored, so I tried living a normal life.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.519" end="00:34:04.080" style="s2">And you, a fraud who&#39;s never done</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.960" end="00:34:05.600" style="s2">anything real, kept calling me a</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.080" end="00:34:06.799" style="s2">housewife. I ignored you because I</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.600" end="00:34:10.000" style="s2">didn&#39;t care, not because I&#39;m easy to</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.799" end="00:34:10.000" style="s2">push around.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.599" end="00:34:16.240" style="s2">No skill and now you&#39;re making a scene.</p>
