<p begin="00:34:16.240" end="00:34:19.280" style="s2">Loser strips and yells I&#39;m trash three</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.159" end="00:34:22.480" style="s2">times. Pay up.</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.280" end="00:34:24.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, don&#39;t stall. Everyone&#39;s watching.</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.480" end="00:34:26.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re all pigs, freaks.</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.960" end="00:34:28.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really think highly of yourself. One</p>
