<p begin="00:34:28.639" end="00:34:32.720" style="s2">makes me sick. Go ahead and strip. No</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.200" end="00:34:36.480" style="s2">matter how desperate [music] we are, we</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.720" end="00:34:40.639" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t touch a woman on your level.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.480" end="00:34:43.359" style="s2">Sasha, you made the bet. Pay up now. No,</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.639" end="00:34:45.679" style="s2">you&#39;re backing out. So what if I am?</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.359" end="00:34:47.760" style="s2">Ivy, no matter how good you are, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.679" end="00:34:50.159" style="s2">still just Vincent Kane&#39;s mistress. A</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.760" end="00:34:52.639" style="s2">dirty, lowown home wrecker. What right</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.159" end="00:34:53.760" style="s2">do you have to talk down to me? Say that</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.639" end="00:34:56.000" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.760" end="00:34:57.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha, you&#39;ve lost your mind. Keep</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.000" end="00:34:58.480" style="s2">talking and I&#39;ll make you regret you</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.119" end="00:34:59.680" style="s2">were born. [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.480" end="00:35:01.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, help me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.680" end="00:35:03.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, let her go. You&#39;re both women. Why</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.599" end="00:35:07.440" style="s2">push it? For my sake, let it go.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.440" end="00:35:10.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. Your sake means nothing to me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.440" end="00:35:10.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STRIP</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.440" end="00:35:16.839" style="s2">STRIP.</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.480" end="00:35:16.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IVY, I&#39;ll take you down with me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.119" end="00:35:29.359" style="s2">family and I&#39;ll cut out your tongue.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.720" end="00:35:30.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I won&#39;t say anything else.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.359" end="00:35:32.720" style="s2">Please let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.880" end="00:35:34.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha,</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.720" end="00:35:35.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; she just has a big mouth. She knows she</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.320" end="00:35:36.160" style="s2">was wrong. I&#39;ll take her out of here</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.440" end="00:35:37.944" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.160" end="00:35:39.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.944" end="00:35:39.964" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.680" end="00:35:45.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made a bet, you pay. Nobody backs</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.839" end="00:35:46.960" style="s2">out of a deal with me in Miami.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.280" end="00:35:48.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s how you do it. Sore losers get</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.960" end="00:35:50.800" style="s2">what they deserve. Know your place. You</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.640" end="00:35:52.160" style="s2">mess with Ivy, you earn this.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.800" end="00:35:54.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.160" end="00:35:55.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it. I was just getting into it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.160" end="00:35:57.200" style="s2">Then stay and enjoy the show. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.920" end="00:35:58.079" style="s2">leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.200" end="00:36:00.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.079" end="00:36:03.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, wait up.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.000" end="00:36:06.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, help me. It&#39;s too slippery. I</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.599" end="00:36:08.079" style="s2">can&#39;t stand up.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.160" end="00:36:11.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy,</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.079" end="00:36:11.880" style="s2">who the hell are you,</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.720" end="00:36:16.079" style="s2">Sasha? Every time you say it&#39;s a sure</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.320" end="00:36:17.359" style="s2">thing, you screw it up. Now, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.079" end="00:36:18.720" style="s2">seriously wondering if you ever actually</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.359" end="00:36:20.480" style="s2">closed any of those deals.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.720" end="00:36:22.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, you know I gave everything to</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.480" end="00:36:23.920" style="s2">this company. Give me one more chance.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.240" end="00:36:26.320" style="s2">I&#39;ll prove it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.920" end="00:36:27.440" style="s2">My trust in you is gone. Every failure</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.320" end="00:36:30.320" style="s2">used it up.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.440" end="00:36:33.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, one last time. I swear it won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.320" end="00:36:34.480" style="s2">go wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.359" end="00:36:36.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your plan?</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.480" end="00:36:38.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Kane family charity gala is in a few</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.560" end="00:36:41.200" style="s2">days. If I can get in, I can meet the</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.800" end="00:36:42.320" style="s2">cane heir. This time, I&#39;ll get the</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.200" end="00:36:45.359" style="s2">partnership back.</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.320" end="00:36:47.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. One more shot. You screw this up,</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.359" end="00:36:49.995" style="s2">pack your things and get out. And don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.200" end="00:36:50.400" style="s2">ever let me see you again.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.995" end="00:36:52.800" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.400" end="00:36:54.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I fought too hard to get here. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.800" end="00:36:59.560" style="s2">getting thrown out. [music] Whatever it</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.880" end="00:36:59.560" style="s2">takes, I&#39;m getting into that gala.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.520" end="00:37:07.839" style="s2">Gh.</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.800" end="00:37:09.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s with the sigh?</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.839" end="00:37:09.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, I need your help. I&#39;m losing my</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.440" end="00:37:11.280" style="s2">mind.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.760" end="00:37:12.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something&#39;s actually driving you crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.280" end="00:37:13.920" style="s2">Do tell.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.320" end="00:37:14.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My dad. He&#39;s trying to set me up with</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.920" end="00:37:16.720" style="s2">some older woman.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.720" end="00:37:20.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Older&#39;s good. She&#39;ll take care of you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.720" end="00:37:22.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s 20 years older than me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.079" end="00:37:23.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God, your dad&#39;s worse than mine. Ivy,</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.000" end="00:37:24.560" style="s2">we&#39;ve known each other our whole lives.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.119" end="00:37:26.720" style="s2">I need you on this one.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.560" end="00:37:28.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can I help?</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.720" end="00:37:29.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.000" end="00:37:33.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that a proposal?</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.920" end="00:37:37.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, will you?</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.680" end="00:37:37.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me think about it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.079" end="00:37:40.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You finally pulled something off. Good</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.760" end="00:37:42.560" style="s2">job.</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.640" end="00:37:44.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax, Chase. Tonight, I&#39;ll make it</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.560" end="00:37:47.691" style="s2">happen. I&#39;ll meet the Canair. Look, Miss</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.720" end="00:37:47.691" style="s2">Kane is here. [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.160" end="00:37:54.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow. She&#39;s stunning.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.640" end="00:38:01.839" style="s2">I thought the real Miss Kane was here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.736" end="00:38:02.560" style="s2">[music] Turns out it&#39;s just the</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.839" end="00:38:04.240" style="s2">knockoff.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.560" end="00:38:06.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy really can&#39;t help herself. She</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.240" end="00:38:10.040" style="s2">doesn&#39;t even know her place. Showing up</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.079" end="00:38:10.040" style="s2">here, that&#39;s just embarrassing.</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.240" end="00:38:15.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, let&#39;s go say hi. Old friends and</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.526" end="00:38:15.720" style="s2">[music] all.</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.760" end="00:38:22.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, this is a Cane family event. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.240" end="00:38:24.960" style="s2">got some nerve showing your face. What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.640" end="00:38:26.480" style="s2">that supposed to mean? Aren&#39;t you afraid</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.960" end="00:38:29.040" style="s2">everyone&#39;s going to find out what you</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.480" end="00:38:32.359" style="s2">really are? The family head&#39;s dirty</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.040" end="00:38:32.359" style="s2">little secret.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.359" end="00:38:38.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are those two? No idea. They look</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.960" end="00:38:40.800" style="s2">unhinged.</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.400" end="00:38:43.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still running your mouth. Sasha, how was</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.800" end="00:38:45.200" style="s2">the fountain water? Want another taste?</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.920" end="00:38:47.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think having money means you can</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.200" end="00:38:48.400" style="s2">threaten people? This is Kain family</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.040" end="00:38:48.800" style="s2">property. You don&#39;t get to run wild</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.400" end="00:38:52.240" style="s2">here,</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.800" end="00:38:54.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy. Take my advice. Leave now. When the</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.240" end="00:38:57.520" style="s2">real Canire shows up and sees you here,</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.880" end="00:39:01.599" style="s2">you think you&#39;ll walk out in one piece?</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.520" end="00:39:03.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s he talking about? I&#39;m lost.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.599" end="00:39:06.000" style="s2">Dressed nice, but clearly got problems</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.920" end="00:39:08.800" style="s2">upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.000" end="00:39:11.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Worry about yourself. Ivy&#39;s not your</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.800" end="00:39:14.560" style="s2">concern. Leo, you&#39;re awfully invested in</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.760" end="00:39:17.680" style="s2">another man&#39;s ex- fiance. That&#39;s a weird</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.560" end="00:39:19.520" style="s2">thing to be into. better than you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.680" end="00:39:21.119" style="s2">Treating trash like treasure and showing</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.520" end="00:39:22.480" style="s2">it off everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.119" end="00:39:25.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.480" end="00:39:27.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, if I remember correctly, Kain</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.440" end="00:39:28.960" style="s2">family never sent the Reed group an</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.040" end="00:39:31.960" style="s2">invitation. [music] So, how&#39;d you get</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.960" end="00:39:31.960" style="s2">in?</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.520" end="00:39:41.200" style="s2">I brought him in. You&#39;re a secretary at</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.320" end="00:39:43.040" style="s2">Reed Group. How&#39;d you get an invitation?</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.200" end="00:39:45.280" style="s2">None of your business. I&#39;m standing</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.040" end="00:39:48.880" style="s2">here, aren&#39;t I? That means I&#39;ve got what</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.280" end="00:39:50.480" style="s2">it takes. Oh, what kind of takes?</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.880" end="00:39:52.640" style="s2">Something you&#39;re not proud of.</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.480" end="00:39:55.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, that&#39;s enough. You have no idea</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.640" end="00:39:57.040" style="s2">what Sasha&#39;s capable of. I won&#39;t let you</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.119" end="00:40:00.480" style="s2">insult her.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.040" end="00:40:01.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, I get it. Love makes you blind.</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.480" end="00:40:02.320" style="s2">But don&#39;t treat everyone else like</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.839" end="00:40:03.920" style="s2">idiots.</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.320" end="00:40:06.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been targeting Sasha from day</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.920" end="00:40:08.800" style="s2">one. You&#39;re just jealous. She&#39;s better</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.160" end="00:40:11.280" style="s2">than you. Chase.</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.800" end="00:40:13.839" style="s2">Short memory. A few days ago, Sasha</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.280" end="00:40:16.400" style="s2">challenged Ivy. riding, shooting, wine</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.839" end="00:40:18.320" style="s2">tasting. She lost every single one.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.400" end="00:40:20.560" style="s2">Better how? Don&#39;t change the subject.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.320" end="00:40:22.640" style="s2">That&#39;s different. Sasha&#39;s strength is in</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.560" end="00:40:24.320" style="s2">business. Last year, Reed Group got back</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.640" end="00:40:25.200" style="s2">on its feet because she closed major</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.320" end="00:40:26.880" style="s2">deals.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.200" end="00:40:28.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really think a secretary closed</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.880" end="00:40:32.000" style="s2">those deals on her own?</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.560" end="00:40:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then who? You.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.000" end="00:40:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, this is the idiot who dumped Miss</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.000" end="00:40:38.640" style="s2">Kaine.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.760" end="00:40:40.160" style="s2">No wonder. Makes sense now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.640" end="00:40:43.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.160" end="00:40:45.599" style="s2">Show me your invitation. No invitation.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.680" end="00:40:48.400" style="s2">You&#39;re out.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.599" end="00:40:50.400" style="s2">This is a Kain family event. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.400" end="00:40:51.839" style="s2">get to give orders here. You can ask</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.400" end="00:40:53.920" style="s2">around about my relationship with the</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.839" end="00:40:55.440" style="s2">Cain family. I&#39;m a personal guest. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.920" end="00:40:58.160" style="s2">got every right to remove people who</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.440" end="00:41:00.720" style="s2">weren&#39;t invited. Security. Escort them</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.160" end="00:41:02.880" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.720" end="00:41:06.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Frank. The head of security</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.880" end="00:41:06.280" style="s2">brought us in.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.200" end="00:41:11.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank?</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.800" end="00:41:13.359" style="s2">Never heard of him. And who are you? Why</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.760" end="00:41:16.079" style="s2">would you know him?</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.359" end="00:41:18.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Head of security. So you two snuck in</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.079" end="00:41:21.280" style="s2">through a side door?</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.880" end="00:41:22.800" style="s2">I thought so. But even the head of</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.280" end="00:41:23.760" style="s2">security doesn&#39;t get to bring random</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.800" end="00:41:25.680" style="s2">people in.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.760" end="00:41:27.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.680" end="00:41:31.040" style="s2">Security is supposed to protect the</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.760" end="00:41:33.680" style="s2">property, not abuse his power. Someone</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.040" end="00:41:36.400" style="s2">like that should be fired. He&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.680" end="00:41:39.359" style="s2">liability. The Cain family doesn&#39;t keep</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.400" end="00:41:41.280" style="s2">people like that. I&#39;ll notify Stone he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.359" end="00:41:43.839" style="s2">fired immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.280" end="00:41:46.240" style="s2">Stop bluffing. This is Kane family</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.839" end="00:41:50.240" style="s2">property. You have no authority here.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.240" end="00:41:52.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. You say fired and he&#39;s fired. You</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.240" end="00:41:55.119" style="s2">think you&#39;re the Kane heir?</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.960" end="00:41:56.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t listen to this anymore. Are you</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.119" end="00:42:00.720" style="s2">too brain dead?</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.640" end="00:42:03.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them talk. The show&#39;s not over.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.720" end="00:42:05.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep acting tough. When the real Kane</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.520" end="00:42:06.480" style="s2">air gets here, I&#39;m telling her</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.680" end="00:42:11.659" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.480" end="00:42:11.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no. I&#39;m so scared. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.240" end="00:42:18.200" style="s2">You think this is funny? I&#39;ll make you</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.640" end="00:42:18.200" style="s2">pay right now.</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.359" end="00:42:26.280" style="s2">Frank, get over here. Someone&#39;s causing</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.920" end="00:42:26.280" style="s2">a steen and saying they&#39;ll fire you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.359" end="00:42:33.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said they&#39;re firing me?</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.640" end="00:42:33.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.880" end="00:42:43.520" style="s2">Wait,</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.640" end="00:42:46.000" style="s2">why does she look so familiar?</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.520" end="00:42:48.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s some rich guy&#39;s play thing. Hangs</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.000" end="00:42:49.200" style="s2">around high-end places. Of course, she</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.160" end="00:42:51.839" style="s2">looks familiar.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.200" end="00:42:54.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, out of respect for our families,</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.839" end="00:42:56.640" style="s2">I&#39;ll handle this. But after tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.400" end="00:42:58.560" style="s2">stay in your lane. Find someone to</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.640" end="00:43:01.560" style="s2">marry. Better than being someone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.560" end="00:43:01.560" style="s2">mistress.</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.920" end="00:43:10.079" style="s2">You&#39;re new here.</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.160" end="00:43:12.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;d you know?</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.079" end="00:43:16.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a closer look. You really don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.960" end="00:43:16.440" style="s2">recognize me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.000" end="00:43:25.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Kane.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.880" end="00:43:33.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve seen her before.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.119" end="00:43:35.359" style="s2">Wait, are you</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.040" end="00:43:37.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank? Don&#39;t let her fool you. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.359" end="00:43:41.359" style="s2">just one of Vincent Kane&#39;s women. Even</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.920" end="00:43:44.160" style="s2">if she&#39;s in favor now,</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.359" end="00:43:45.680" style="s2">she&#39;ll be thrown out eventually. Word is</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.160" end="00:43:47.520" style="s2">Miss Kane is taking over the whole</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.680" end="00:43:50.160" style="s2">family business. You hand this home</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.520" end="00:43:53.400" style="s2">wrecker over to her, you&#39;ll be rewarded.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.160" end="00:43:53.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.800" end="00:43:58.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t blame me for this.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.040" end="00:44:09.240" style="s2">Who did you just call my mistress?</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.880" end="00:44:22.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who are you? Some old geyser? Nobody</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.960" end="00:44:22.280" style="s2">asked you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.880" end="00:44:28.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your mouth. You&#39;re talking to Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.359" end="00:44:32.160" style="s2">Kain. Wait,</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.480" end="00:44:34.800" style="s2">he&#39;s Vincent Kaine.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.160" end="00:44:37.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You spread lies about Miss Kane and</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.800" end="00:44:41.640" style="s2">insult Mr. Kane&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.839" end="00:44:41.640" style="s2">I&#39;m just getting started.</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.440" end="00:44:47.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That felt good.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.359" end="00:44:50.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boring.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.839" end="00:44:51.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Reed&#39;s son. You You know my</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.800" end="00:44:53.440" style="s2">father?</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.680" end="00:44:56.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Goodlook.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.440" end="00:45:00.520" style="s2">Shame you didn&#39;t get his brains.</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.240" end="00:45:00.520" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing compared to him.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.560" end="00:45:05.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Kane, we were just trying to help</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.880" end="00:45:07.920" style="s2">you get rid of this woman. She&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.359" end="00:45:11.760" style="s2">mistress. Showing up in public like this</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.920" end="00:45:16.000" style="s2">hurts the Cain family&#39;s reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.760" end="00:45:20.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. You dare slander Miss Kane?</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.000" end="00:45:22.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not slandering her. Leo admitted it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.240" end="00:45:25.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this about?</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.480" end="00:45:25.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.520" end="00:45:31.280" style="s2">Leo, you&#39;re close with the Cain family.</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.520" end="00:45:32.960" style="s2">You must know about the family head.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.280" end="00:45:34.720" style="s2">There are rumors that Ivy and he are</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.960" end="00:45:36.560" style="s2">kind involved. Is that true?</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.720" end="00:45:38.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a pretty private matter. Who&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.560" end="00:45:40.480" style="s2">you hear it from? Watch what you say.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.960" end="00:45:42.079" style="s2">You might get yourself in trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.480" end="00:45:44.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good thing I recorded that. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.079" end="00:45:46.880" style="s2">Otherwise, I&#39;d be the one in trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.240" end="00:45:49.040" style="s2">Sasha, I warned you. You made things up</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.880" end="00:45:51.920" style="s2">and tried to pin it on me. [music] She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.040" end="00:45:55.280" style="s2">not the family head&#39;s mistress. Then who</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.920" end="00:46:00.680" style="s2">is she? You still don&#39;t get it. Listen</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.280" end="00:46:00.680" style="s2">carefully. Ivy is my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.839" end="00:46:06.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s She&#39;s the cane.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.359" end="00:46:12.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay right there.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.520" end="00:46:20.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know I was wrong. Please let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.079" end="00:46:22.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly did you do wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.160" end="00:46:25.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I broke the rules. I brought them in.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.560" end="00:46:28.240" style="s2">Miss Kane, please give me a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.200" end="00:46:30.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why&#39;d you bring them in? What did Sasha</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.240" end="00:46:32.000" style="s2">promise you? What&#39;s going on between you</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.640" end="00:46:33.040" style="s2">two?</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.000" end="00:46:36.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.040" end="00:46:39.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s my uncle.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.240" end="00:46:42.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha, you really have no limits. Even</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.520" end="00:46:42.920" style="s2">your own uncle?</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.760" end="00:46:48.880" style="s2">That&#39;s nasty. Even an old greasy guy</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.319" end="00:46:53.240" style="s2">like that. How desperate is she? No</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.880" end="00:46:53.240" style="s2">wonder she got in. Disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.119" end="00:46:59.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.640" end="00:47:03.680" style="s2">Let me go. [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.599" end="00:47:05.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is what you MEANT BY WHAT IT TAKES.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.680" end="00:47:06.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CHASE, it&#39;s not like that. Let me</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.920" end="00:47:08.960" style="s2">explain.</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.880" end="00:47:11.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain what</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.960" end="00:47:13.680" style="s2">I&#39;m asking you. Those deals you closed</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.440" end="00:47:17.119" style="s2">for the company, did you sleep your way</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.680" end="00:47:20.880" style="s2">into those, too?</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.119" end="00:47:22.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely not. A woman like her, I</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.880" end="00:47:25.200" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t touch her. I did business with</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.800" end="00:47:27.040" style="s2">Reed Group because of Miss Kain.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.200" end="00:47:28.319" style="s2">Exactly. If Miss Kane hadn&#39;t called</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.040" end="00:47:30.640" style="s2">personally, I wouldn&#39;t have given a</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.319" end="00:47:32.960" style="s2">dying company a second look. Sasha tried</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.640" end="00:47:35.520" style="s2">to flirt with me. I wasn&#39;t interested.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.960" end="00:47:37.520" style="s2">Same. She was just the messenger.</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.520" end="00:47:39.763" style="s2">Without Miss Kane, Reed Groupoup would</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.520" end="00:47:40.000" style="s2">have been dead a year ago.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.763" end="00:47:41.760" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.000" end="00:47:44.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the past year, I&#39;ve been the one</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.760" end="00:47:46.319" style="s2">helping Reed Group. And you? You</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.640" end="00:47:49.119" style="s2">listened to Sasha and gave her all the</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.319" end="00:47:51.119" style="s2">credit. Chase, I never wanted credit.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.119" end="00:47:55.000" style="s2">But I&#39;m not letting her take mine and</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.119" end="00:47:55.000" style="s2">treat me like an idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.520" end="00:48:00.160" style="s2">Chase, don&#39;t listen to them. It&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.000" end="00:48:01.119" style="s2">like that. You know how much I&#39;ve done</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.160" end="00:48:04.480" style="s2">for the company.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.119" end="00:48:07.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m an idiot. I gave up the cane air for</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.480" end="00:48:09.680" style="s2">someone like you. Sasha, you&#39;re fired.</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.920" end="00:48:12.513" style="s2">Get out of my sight and don&#39;t ever come</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.680" end="00:48:14.533" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.513" end="00:48:14.533" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.160" end="00:48:22.880" style="s2">I&#39;m announcing this now. My daughter Ivy</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.319" end="00:48:25.920" style="s2">Kaine will take over the Kain family</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.880" end="00:48:27.578" style="s2">business as its new head effective</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.920" end="00:48:29.598" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.578" end="00:48:29.598" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.953" end="00:48:45.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.880" end="00:48:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;d I do back there?</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.720" end="00:48:56.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not bad, but I want the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.960" end="00:48:58.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean Chase and Sasha thinking you</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.880" end="00:48:59.673" style="s2">were a mistress?</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.079" end="00:49:01.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You set that up on purpose, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.673" end="00:49:02.800" style="s2">[music] You&#39;re sneaky.</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.119" end="00:49:04.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I don&#39;t play a little dirty, how am I</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.800" end="00:49:05.599" style="s2">supposed to get a shot at you?</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.559" end="00:49:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.599" end="00:49:09.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re idiots. They only believe what</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.520" end="00:49:12.400" style="s2">they want to believe.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.760" end="00:49:14.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything else you&#39;re hiding from me?</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.400" end="00:49:16.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, yeah. I booked the golf course</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.160" end="00:49:19.040" style="s2">for tomorrow. Want to play?</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.160" end="00:49:21.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You already booked it before asking me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.040" end="00:49:25.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you in?</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.760" end="00:49:26.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. But you have to promise me no more</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.040" end="00:49:30.440" style="s2">secrets.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.800" end="00:49:30.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything for you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.640" end="00:49:37.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, wait.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.720" end="00:49:40.960" style="s2">I need to talk to you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.839" end="00:49:43.040" style="s2">This is between me and Ivy. Move. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.960" end="00:49:44.319" style="s2">been in love with Ivy for years. If you</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.040" end="00:49:46.240" style="s2">two didn&#39;t have an engagement, I would</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.319" end="00:49:49.119" style="s2">have made my move a long time ago. You</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.240" end="00:49:51.920" style="s2">let her down. You don&#39;t deserve her.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.119" end="00:49:56.000" style="s2">Ivy, I was wrong before. I</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.920" end="00:50:02.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; don&#39;t. We&#39;ve been over for a long time.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.000" end="00:50:02.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I&#39;m not giving up. Not a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.800" end="00:50:12.319" style="s2">Chase, you&#39;re like a shadow. Can&#39;t shake</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.839" end="00:50:16.000" style="s2">you. I&#39;m not here for you. Stay out of</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.319" end="00:50:17.839" style="s2">it. Ivy, I came here to apologize. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.000" end="00:50:19.920" style="s2">thought it through. I&#39;m willing to go</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.839" end="00:50:21.040" style="s2">through with the engagement again. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.920" end="00:50:23.280" style="s2">get married.</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.040" end="00:50:25.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, if you&#39;ve got brain damage, go</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.280" end="00:50:26.160" style="s2">get it looked at. Don&#39;t stand here and</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.280" end="00:50:28.319" style="s2">disgust me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.160" end="00:50:30.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, what more do you want? I&#39;m already</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.319" end="00:50:32.400" style="s2">apologizing.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.400" end="00:50:34.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s your idea of an apology? I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.400" end="00:50:36.880" style="s2">never bowed my head to anyone, but I</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.319" end="00:50:38.880" style="s2">fired Sasha for you. That&#39;s not enough.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.880" end="00:50:40.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save it for someone who cares. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.880" end="00:50:42.559" style="s2">need your sincerity.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.160" end="00:50:44.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve made enough concessions. Don&#39;t push</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.559" end="00:50:46.240" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.240" end="00:50:49.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you to threaten her? This is</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.240" end="00:50:50.800" style="s2">between me and Ivy. Stay out of it. Ivy,</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.200" end="00:50:55.319" style="s2">are you coming with me or not?</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.800" end="00:50:55.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, wake up. You&#39;re dreaming.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.680" end="00:51:01.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stupid and arrogant. You really think</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.240" end="00:51:05.599" style="s2">you deserve Ivy? Leo, you&#39;re going too</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.680" end="00:51:08.079" style="s2">far. Move. You won&#39;t listen to reason.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.599" end="00:51:11.330" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.079" end="00:51:13.350" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.330" end="00:51:13.350" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.680" end="00:51:32.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.040" end="00:51:32.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My leg. I can&#39;t put any weight on it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.040" end="00:51:38.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who did this?</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.400" end="00:51:39.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. Don&#39;t blame Chase. It was an</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.800" end="00:51:42.160" style="s2">accident.</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.520" end="00:51:45.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, that was out of line. Apologize</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.160" end="00:51:46.800" style="s2">to Leo now.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.040" end="00:51:49.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, my ankle.</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.800" end="00:51:50.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, that was out of line. Apologize to</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.280" end="00:51:53.280" style="s2">Sasha now.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.480" end="00:51:56.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s framing me. I didn&#39;t touch him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.280" end="00:51:59.040" style="s2">Ivy, let it go. Chase has always been</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.000" end="00:52:02.000" style="s2">arrogant. Don&#39;t make it worse for him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.040" end="00:52:04.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, I&#39;m giving you one more chance.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.000" end="00:52:06.880" style="s2">Apologize to Leo now.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.160" end="00:52:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow, that hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.880" end="00:52:10.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, I&#39;m giving you one more chance.</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.400" end="00:52:12.240" style="s2">Apologize to Sasha now.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.319" end="00:52:13.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, this is what it feels like to be set</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.240" end="00:52:16.079" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.200" end="00:52:18.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, I admit I misjudged you before, but</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.079" end="00:52:21.040" style="s2">I didn&#39;t do this. I&#39;m not apologizing.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.880" end="00:52:24.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you won&#39;t own up to it, don&#39;t blame</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.040" end="00:52:24.359" style="s2">me for this.</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.480" end="00:52:37.000" style="s2">Ow. Ivy, help me out. My leg&#39;s killing</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.000" end="00:52:37.000" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.240" end="00:52:48.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s hit the stables next.</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.000" end="00:52:50.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re limping. You can still ride.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.559" end="00:52:53.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s better now. I&#39;ll be fine.</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.720" end="00:52:55.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drop the act. You&#39;re a billionaire CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.599" end="00:52:57.040" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this a little beneath you?</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.440" end="00:52:58.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all for you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.040" end="00:53:00.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks. Really?</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.880" end="00:53:03.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.720" end="00:53:04.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In your dreams.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.200" end="00:53:06.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure you won&#39;t regret that?</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.720" end="00:53:08.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drop the act. I know you&#39;d do anything</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.480" end="00:53:09.599" style="s2">to marry me. Too bad a crude woman like</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.480" end="00:53:11.839" style="s2">you doesn&#39;t deserve me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.599" end="00:53:12.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, I&#39;m asking you one last time. You</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.839" end="00:53:14.240" style="s2">sure you won&#39;t regret this?</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.960" end="00:53:16.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sure.</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.240" end="00:53:19.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, you want me to crawl back and admit</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.720" end="00:53:23.400" style="s2">I was wrong? Not happening. Chase Reed</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.520" end="00:53:23.400" style="s2">doesn&#39;t bow to anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.000" end="00:53:35.480" style="s2">What do you want,</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.559" end="00:53:35.480" style="s2">Chase? I can&#39;t stop thinking about you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.559" end="00:53:44.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha, you&#39;re dirty, cheap, and</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.640" end="00:53:46.960" style="s2">shameless. You humiliated me in front of</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.960" end="00:53:50.079" style="s2">the whole city, and you show your face</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.960" end="00:53:53.119" style="s2">here. Get out. You make me sick. Chase,</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.079" end="00:53:55.839" style="s2">that video was fake. Ivy set me up.</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.119" end="00:53:59.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if it was, those CEOs, were they</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.839" end="00:54:00.480" style="s2">all lying, too? Stop making excuses. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.200" end="00:54:02.720" style="s2">done believing you.</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.480" end="00:54:04.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you won&#39;t believe me. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.720" end="00:54:07.760" style="s2">asking for forgiveness. I just want to</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.960" end="00:54:12.240" style="s2">help you. Help Reed Group.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.760" end="00:54:14.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You What can you do?</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.240" end="00:54:16.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I gave everything to Reed Group. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.480" end="00:54:17.040" style="s2">put my feelings aside to help you win</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.000" end="00:54:19.440" style="s2">Ivy back.</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.040" end="00:54:20.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s too late. She won&#39;t even look at</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.440" end="00:54:25.400" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.240" end="00:54:25.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, I have a way to get her back.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.040" end="00:54:40.000" style="s2">Hello everyone. We&#39;re here at the</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.960" end="00:54:42.480" style="s2">mangroves on Miami&#39;s Southshore. Today,</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.000" end="00:54:45.359" style="s2">Ivy Kane, the new head of the Cane</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.480" end="00:54:49.000" style="s2">family, is releasing a rehabilitated</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.359" end="00:54:49.000" style="s2">short-tailed hawk.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.160" end="00:54:53.680" style="s2">Miss Kane has supported wildlife rescue</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.000" end="00:54:55.599" style="s2">for years. Today, she&#39;s personally</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.680" end="00:54:58.599" style="s2">returning this hawk to the wild where it</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.599" end="00:54:58.599" style="s2">belongs.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.079" end="00:55:10.000" style="s2">Miss Kain, please let me go. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.119" end="00:55:12.480" style="s2">killing me. Why is she crying like that?</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.000" end="00:55:16.680" style="s2">She looks pitiful. What did they do to</p>
<p begin="00:55:12.480" end="00:55:16.680" style="s2">her to make her beg on her knees?</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.960" end="00:55:21.119" style="s2">Let her talk. I want to hear what she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.040" end="00:55:22.480" style="s2">been through. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.119" end="00:55:24.319" style="s2">Miss Kane, there&#39;s nothing between me</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.480" end="00:55:26.000" style="s2">and Chase. I never did anything wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.319" end="00:55:27.680" style="s2">You can&#39;t force Chase to fire me just</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.000" end="00:55:32.023" style="s2">because of a misunderstanding. I&#39;m just</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.680" end="00:55:32.319" style="s2">a secretary. I just want basic dignity.</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.023" end="00:55:35.200" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.319" end="00:55:38.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great performance. Keep going.</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.200" end="00:55:39.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were born with everything.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.079" end="00:55:41.839" style="s2">You don&#39;t know how hard it is for</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.760" end="00:55:44.720" style="s2">regular people.</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.839" end="00:55:47.599" style="s2">I came from nothing. I studied my ass</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.720" end="00:55:49.359" style="s2">off. I finally found a job. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.599" end="00:55:50.720" style="s2">use me as a scapegoat just because you</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.359" end="00:55:54.280" style="s2">like Leo and want to break your</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.720" end="00:55:54.280" style="s2">engagement with Chase.</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.000" end="00:55:59.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So rich people can just crush regular</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.400" end="00:56:01.680" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.200" end="00:56:05.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She studied for years, finally got a</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.680" end="00:56:08.160" style="s2">job, and it&#39;s gone. That&#39;s terrible. I</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.680" end="00:56:10.559" style="s2">can&#39;t believe it. She does wildlife</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.160" end="00:56:13.799" style="s2">charity in public, but abuses her power</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.559" end="00:56:13.799" style="s2">in private.</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.760" end="00:56:20.480" style="s2">You done?</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.680" end="00:56:23.880" style="s2">Sasha, you&#39;re playing the wrong role in</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.480" end="00:56:23.880" style="s2">the wrong place.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.119" end="00:56:29.440" style="s2">What are you talking about? One, Chase</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.599" end="00:56:32.000" style="s2">fired you. What&#39;s that got to do with</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.440" end="00:56:34.000" style="s2">me? Two, you say nothing happened</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.000" end="00:56:36.000" style="s2">between you and Chase. I can&#39;t prove it</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.000" end="00:56:37.440" style="s2">either way, but there are things plenty</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.000" end="00:56:38.880" style="s2">of people saw. Chase bought you a</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.440" end="00:56:40.640" style="s2">million-dollar necklace. You shared a</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.880" end="00:56:42.720" style="s2">room on every business trip. At every</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.640" end="00:56:44.160" style="s2">event, you were on his arm. And three,</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.720" end="00:56:46.480" style="s2">Chase called off the engagement in</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.160" end="00:56:47.839" style="s2">public. If I was already with Leo, why</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.480" end="00:56:50.319" style="s2">would I put myself through a whole year</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.839" end="00:56:52.480" style="s2">of that? She made it all up. She lied to</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.319" end="00:56:54.160" style="s2">us, wearing a necklace from the CEO,</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.480" end="00:56:55.760" style="s2">always attached to him, and she says</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.160" end="00:56:58.960" style="s2">nothing happened. She&#39;s using our</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.760" end="00:57:00.480" style="s2">sympathy. That&#39;s disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.960" end="00:57:02.000" style="s2">Ivy,</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.480" end="00:57:05.680" style="s2">just because you&#39;re a cane doesn&#39;t make</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.000" end="00:57:07.200" style="s2">you better than me. You&#39;re jealous.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.680" end="00:57:09.359" style="s2">From head to toe, is there anything</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.200" end="00:57:13.200" style="s2">about you worth being jealous of? Your</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.359" end="00:57:15.680" style="s2">lies? Your act?</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.200" end="00:57:16.480" style="s2">Show&#39;s over. Leave. We&#39;re here for a</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.680" end="00:57:18.559" style="s2">cause.</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.480" end="00:57:20.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t make me leave. Not until this</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.559" end="00:57:26.119" style="s2">is cleared up.</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.960" end="00:57:26.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. You asked for this.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.679" end="00:57:46.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.319" end="00:57:47.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look what you did.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.079" end="00:57:49.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.040" end="00:57:50.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody even knew about us. Now the whole</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.040" end="00:57:54.880" style="s2">internet knows. Everyone&#39;s calling me</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.880" end="00:57:57.920" style="s2">stupid, blind, a cheater.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.880" end="00:57:59.280" style="s2">After this mess, Ivy&#39;s never giving me</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.920" end="00:58:02.000" style="s2">another chance.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.280" end="00:58:04.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, calm down. Ivy won&#39;t come back</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.000" end="00:58:06.160" style="s2">because Reed Group is about to go under.</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.240" end="00:58:10.839" style="s2">If we land a big project and turn the</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.160" end="00:58:10.839" style="s2">company around, she&#39;ll change her mind.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.200" end="00:58:17.040" style="s2">You&#39;re right. I&#39;m talented. If I get one</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.960" end="00:58:20.720" style="s2">opportunity, I can rebuild Reed Group</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.040" end="00:58:23.280" style="s2">and make everyone eat their words.</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.720" end="00:58:27.200" style="s2">Chase and Sasha keep showing up, causing</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.280" end="00:58:30.880" style="s2">scenes, harassing Ivy, I&#39;ve had enough.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.200" end="00:58:32.880" style="s2">Leo, what are you up to?</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.880" end="00:58:37.079" style="s2">I mean, you&#39;re smart. You&#39;ve already got</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.880" end="00:58:37.079" style="s2">a plan. Come here.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.760" end="00:58:56.880" style="s2">Chase, good news. I just got us a bid</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.440" end="00:58:58.319" style="s2">slot with an overseas multimunal. The</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.880" end="00:58:59.599" style="s2">Kane family can&#39;t touch us outside the</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.319" end="00:59:01.280" style="s2">country. They reached out to me a year</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.599" end="00:59:02.799" style="s2">ago. Wanted to work with Reed Group. I</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.280" end="00:59:04.799" style="s2">passed. Too much hassle. Now they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.799" end="00:59:07.359" style="s2">rebidding. This is our shot.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.799" end="00:59:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? If we land this, Reed Groupoup</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.359" end="00:59:09.760" style="s2">is back.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.400" end="00:59:10.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve got this. There&#39;s nothing better</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.760" end="00:59:11.760" style="s2">on the table.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.480" end="00:59:13.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This deal decides whether Reed Group</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.760" end="00:59:16.079" style="s2">lives or dies. I&#39;m handling it</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.200" end="00:59:18.640" style="s2">personally right now. Chase, I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.079" end="00:59:20.319" style="s2">We&#39;re not signing with Reedroup. Why?</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.640" end="00:59:23.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came to us a year ago. Now you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.319" end="00:59:24.720" style="s2">rebidding. Why cut us out? A year ago,</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.359" end="00:59:26.400" style="s2">we were willing to work with Reed</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.720" end="00:59:28.319" style="s2">Groupoup because Mrs. Kane personally</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.400" end="00:59:29.680" style="s2">guaranteed your credit. But now, the</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.319" end="00:59:31.760" style="s2">Kane family has withdrawn that</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.680" end="00:59:33.280" style="s2">guarantee. Without Miss Kane&#39;s backing,</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.760" end="00:59:35.359" style="s2">Reedgroup doesn&#39;t qualify for any</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.280" end="00:59:37.760" style="s2">partnership with us. Victor, we can</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.359" end="00:59:39.440" style="s2">renegotiate. Reed Groupoup is top tire</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.760" end="00:59:41.599" style="s2">in the industry. We can adjust the</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.440" end="00:59:42.559" style="s2">terms, lower your risk. Just give us</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.599" end="00:59:44.880" style="s2">another look.</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.559" end="00:59:46.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, this was decided by our executive</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.880" end="00:59:49.480" style="s2">team. I don&#39;t have the authority to</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.319" end="00:59:49.480" style="s2">change it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.200" end="00:59:55.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? I&#39;m on my way.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.400" end="01:00:00.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, we&#39;re here to formally resign.</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.921" end="01:00:02.640" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.480" end="01:00:04.079" style="s2">You&#39;re the best people we have. The</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.640" end="01:00:05.920" style="s2">company&#39;s on the ropes. If you leave,</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.079" end="01:00:07.760" style="s2">Reed Coupoop is done. Double your</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.920" end="01:00:08.720" style="s2">salary, double your bonus, whatever you</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.760" end="01:00:11.280" style="s2">want. Name it.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.720" end="01:00:12.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, honestly,</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.280" end="01:00:18.720" style="s2">we didn&#39;t come to Reed Groupoup for the</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.720" end="01:00:20.960" style="s2">money. We came from Mrs. Kain. What?</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.720" end="01:00:22.559" style="s2">We&#39;re all from small towns. No money for</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.960" end="01:00:23.920" style="s2">school. [music] The Kane family</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.559" end="01:00:26.000" style="s2">scholarship program paid for our</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.920" end="01:00:28.000" style="s2">education. That&#39;s the only reason we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.000" end="01:00:29.760" style="s2">here. A year ago, Miss Kane knew Reed</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.000" end="01:00:31.280" style="s2">Group was struggling and losing talent.</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.760" end="01:00:33.119" style="s2">She brought us in personally to turn</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.280" end="01:00:35.359" style="s2">things around. Miss Kane knew you were</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.119" end="01:00:37.680" style="s2">proud. She told us never to say a word.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.359" end="01:00:39.760" style="s2">She wanted to protect your ego. Chase,</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.680" end="01:00:41.760" style="s2">honestly, your vision doesn&#39;t match</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.760" end="01:00:43.280" style="s2">hers. She gave you everything and you</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.760" end="01:00:46.559" style="s2">listened to the wrong people. You</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.280" end="01:00:48.000" style="s2">destroyed your own future.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.559" end="01:00:49.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She gave you everything and you listened</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.000" end="01:00:50.559" style="s2">to the wrong people. You destroyed your</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.839" end="01:00:52.480" style="s2">own future.</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.559" end="01:00:54.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Chase built Reed Group</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.480" end="01:00:55.680" style="s2">with his own two hands. Ivy had nothing</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.000" end="01:00:58.680" style="s2">to do with it. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.680" end="01:00:58.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.440" end="01:01:03.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, wait up.</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.480" end="01:01:13.040" style="s2">Nolan, your group has deep roots. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.280" end="01:01:15.280" style="s2">top of the industry. I&#39;ve been wanting</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.040" end="01:01:17.760" style="s2">to work with you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.280" end="01:01:19.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, I can feel your sincerity. Let me</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.760" end="01:01:21.440" style="s2">take the proposal back and look it over.</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.440" end="01:01:25.480" style="s2">I&#39;ll get back to you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.440" end="01:01:25.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your time. I&#39;ll be waiting.</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.400" end="01:01:30.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looking forward to working together.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.079" end="01:01:32.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sure we will.</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.880" end="01:01:36.040" style="s2">Nolan, let me walk you out.</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.799" end="01:01:36.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.400" end="01:01:49.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan. Hello. I&#39;m Sasha from Reed Group.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.280" end="01:01:52.640" style="s2">I know this is forward, but I&#39;d like to</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.359" end="01:01:55.200" style="s2">talk to you about a partnership.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.640" end="01:01:57.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, just like you said, she took the</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.200" end="01:02:00.960" style="s2">bait. Finally. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.680" end="01:02:00.960" style="s2">Problem solved.</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.599" end="01:02:07.440" style="s2">A year ago, we were willing to work with</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.440" end="01:02:09.520" style="s2">Reedgroup because Mrs. Kane personally</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.440" end="01:02:10.960" style="s2">guaranteed your credit. A year ago, Miss</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.520" end="01:02:12.720" style="s2">Kane knew Reed Group was struggling and</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.960" end="01:02:16.680" style="s2">losing talent. She brought us in</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.720" end="01:02:16.680" style="s2">personally to turn things around.</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.520" end="01:02:23.119" style="s2">So, Ivy was helping me the whole time,</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.480" end="01:02:26.240" style="s2">and I never knew.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.119" end="01:02:27.760" style="s2">By the time I figured it out, it was too</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.240" end="01:02:29.680" style="s2">late.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.760" end="01:02:33.160" style="s2">figure it out. Oh, and I left you a</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.680" end="01:02:33.160" style="s2">surprise. Enjoy.</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.200" end="01:02:52.960" style="s2">Chase, this is Nolan, CEO of Nolan</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.200" end="01:02:54.160" style="s2">Group. He&#39;s got a premium project. Took</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.960" end="01:02:57.960" style="s2">some work to get him here, but I think</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.160" end="01:02:57.960" style="s2">we can make this a deep partnership.</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.520" end="01:03:04.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan, thanks for giving Reed Groupoup</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.520" end="01:03:06.480" style="s2">this chance.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.240" end="01:03:08.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan, don&#39;t worry. If we partner up,</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.480" end="01:03:09.920" style="s2">Reed Groupoup can under the market and</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.079" end="01:03:12.160" style="s2">give you margins nobody else can match.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.920" end="01:03:13.760" style="s2">You&#39;ll make more profit. I&#39;ll consider</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.160" end="01:03:16.160" style="s2">working with you, but I have one</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.760" end="01:03:18.640" style="s2">condition. Reedroup pays a $50 million</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.160" end="01:03:19.839" style="s2">goodf deposit upfront. Nolan, that&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.640" end="01:03:21.920" style="s2">standard. I&#39;ve never heard of that in</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.839" end="01:03:23.920" style="s2">this industry. Standards [music] change.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.920" end="01:03:25.839" style="s2">Reedroup&#39;s reputation is in the gutter.</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.920" end="01:03:27.680" style="s2">Your cash flow could dry up any day.</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.839" end="01:03:30.720" style="s2">Deals keep falling apart. Everyone knows</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.680" end="01:03:32.400" style="s2">it. I want the deposit because if I</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.720" end="01:03:35.599" style="s2">invest upfront costs and you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.400" end="01:03:38.079" style="s2">deliver, I&#39;m the one holding the bag.</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.599" end="01:03:40.480" style="s2">That money is my risk protection. If you</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.079" end="01:03:42.880" style="s2">don&#39;t like it, we walk. Honestly, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.480" end="01:03:44.960" style="s2">already close to a deal with Leo. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.880" end="01:03:46.319" style="s2">only here because of Sasha. Otherwise, I</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.960" end="01:03:47.359" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t even consider Reed Group.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.319" end="01:03:50.799" style="s2">Goodbye.</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.359" end="01:03:52.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, don&#39;t let him walk. Leo Group is</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.799" end="01:03:55.680" style="s2">already ahead of us. If Leo takes this</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.799" end="01:03:58.160" style="s2">too, Reed Group is finished.</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.680" end="01:04:00.240" style="s2">50 million is a lot. But if we land</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.160" end="01:04:02.160" style="s2">this, the company survives. Compared to</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.240" end="01:04:05.160" style="s2">the return, it&#39;s nothing. Think about</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.160" end="01:04:05.160" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.200" end="01:04:10.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, I&#39;m not forcing you. Take a day.</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.599" end="01:04:11.680" style="s2">Get back to me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.240" end="01:04:12.720" style="s2">50 million. We don&#39;t have that kind of</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.680" end="01:04:15.440" style="s2">cash on hand.</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.720" end="01:04:17.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, this is our only shot. You&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.440" end="01:04:19.359" style="s2">that villa worth 100 million. Mortgage</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.599" end="01:04:22.599" style="s2">it. I&#39;ll put in all my savings. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.359" end="01:04:22.599" style="s2">make it work.</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.960" end="01:04:27.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once we sign, Reed Group is back. When</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.599" end="01:04:31.559" style="s2">you&#39;re on top again, Ivy will see what</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.280" end="01:04:31.559" style="s2">you&#39;re made of. She&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.400" end="01:04:35.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.240" end="01:04:38.240" style="s2">Let&#39;s do it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.680" end="01:04:40.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s with the face?</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.240" end="01:04:43.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, be honest with me. Do you still</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.319" end="01:04:44.240" style="s2">have feelings for Chase?</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.119" end="01:04:46.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.240" end="01:04:48.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t play dumb. I know you. If you had</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.960" end="01:04:51.119" style="s2">zero feelings, you wouldn&#39;t have stayed</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.079" end="01:04:53.039" style="s2">with him for a whole year.</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.119" end="01:04:54.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re jealous.</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.039" end="01:04:57.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my girlfriend. Am I not allowed</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.720" end="01:05:00.319" style="s2">to be? [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.920" end="01:05:03.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m serious. Answer me.</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.319" end="01:05:03.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy.</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.839" end="01:05:10.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, wait. I need to tell you something.</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.319" end="01:05:13.920" style="s2">Chase, enough. Stop chasing her. Shut</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.880" end="01:05:15.839" style="s2">up. This doesn&#39;t concern you. Ivy, I</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.920" end="01:05:17.520" style="s2">know everything now. You&#39;ve been helping</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.839" end="01:05:19.839" style="s2">me this whole year. I&#39;m telling you now</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.520" end="01:05:22.079" style="s2">officially, I&#39;m not marrying anyone but</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.839" end="01:05:23.200" style="s2">you. Your company&#39;s about to go bankrupt</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.079" end="01:05:24.559" style="s2">and you think you can reach the Kane</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.200" end="01:05:26.559" style="s2">family head. Where&#39;s the confidence</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.559" end="01:05:28.720" style="s2">coming from? Mary Ivy in your dreams.</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.559" end="01:05:30.559" style="s2"> I just signed a billion dollar</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.720" end="01:05:32.720" style="s2">deal. Reed Groupoup is coming back. So</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.559" end="01:05:34.319" style="s2">what? At its peak, Reed Group barely hit</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.720" end="01:05:36.319" style="s2">a billion. That&#39;s less than 1% of the</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.319" end="01:05:38.880" style="s2">Kane family&#39;s net worth. Leo, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.319" end="01:05:40.559" style="s2">pushing it. Both of you stop.</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.880" end="01:05:43.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ivy, you need to choose right now. Him</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.559" end="01:05:46.680" style="s2">or me. Ivy, I&#39;ve learned my lesson. I</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.039" end="01:05:46.680" style="s2">won&#39;t let you down again.</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.720" end="01:05:54.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve made my choice. Leo, from now on,</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.359" end="01:05:57.039" style="s2">Chase, don&#39;t come near me again.</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.720" end="01:05:59.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, if you&#39;re a man, respect her</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.039" end="01:06:03.640" style="s2">choice. And do yourself a favor. Look</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.839" end="01:06:03.640" style="s2">into that Nolan guy.</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.799" end="01:06:11.839" style="s2">Chase, I did what you asked. I looked</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.160" end="01:06:13.520" style="s2">into Nolan Group. Their finances, their</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.839" end="01:06:16.160" style="s2">records, everything. I&#39;ve got results.</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.520" end="01:06:18.000" style="s2">Talk. Nolan Group has no legitimate</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.160" end="01:06:19.680" style="s2">operating license. It&#39;s a shell company.</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.000" end="01:06:21.039" style="s2">The 50 million you wired, it was split</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.680" end="01:06:23.599" style="s2">and moved out the same day. All into</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.039" end="01:06:25.440" style="s2">anonymous overseas accounts.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.599" end="01:06:26.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 50 million</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.440" end="01:06:28.559" style="s2">all gone?</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.480" end="01:06:31.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. And it&#39;s untraceable. We&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.559" end="01:06:31.960" style="s2">getting it back.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.599" end="01:06:38.880" style="s2">How? [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.039" end="01:06:40.720" style="s2">Everything looked fine when we signed.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.880" end="01:06:42.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your premium partner. This is</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.720" end="01:06:42.480" style="s2">the deal that was supposed to save Reedg</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.160" end="01:06:44.240" style="s2">Groupoup.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.480" end="01:06:46.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was trying to help the company. How</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.240" end="01:06:48.640" style="s2">was I supposed to know he was a scammer?</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.240" end="01:06:50.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t know? You&#39;re short-sighted,</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.640" end="01:06:52.960" style="s2">greedy, and you can&#39;t even spot a con.</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.799" end="01:06:53.680" style="s2">Because of you, Reedgroup is wiped out.</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.960" end="01:06:55.839" style="s2">Done.</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.680" end="01:06:58.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the one who can&#39;t spot a con. I put</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.839" end="01:07:00.000" style="s2">in every dime I had for that deposit. I</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.000" end="01:07:02.000" style="s2">mortgaged my place. I risked everything</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.000" end="01:07:05.280" style="s2">for you. You don&#39;t get to call me</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.000" end="01:07:07.119" style="s2">useless. Face it. You&#39;re the one who&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.280" end="01:07:09.599" style="s2">useless.</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.119" end="01:07:11.839" style="s2">Without Ivy, you can&#39;t do anything.</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.599" end="01:07:15.079" style="s2">Chase, you&#39;re a loser.</p>
<p begin="01:07:11.839" end="01:07:15.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.501" end="01:07:17.521" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.079" end="01:07:27.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, you hit me. You&#39;re going to pay</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.559" end="01:07:27.720" style="s2">for that.</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.839" end="01:07:35.039" style="s2">Chase, you think you&#39;re better than</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.280" end="01:07:38.400" style="s2">everyone? Today, I&#39;m going to show you</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.039" end="01:07:43.000" style="s2">exactly what you are. A loser. This</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.400" end="01:07:43.000" style="s2">money is mine. You owe me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.880" end="01:07:49.760" style="s2">What are you doing, Chase? Your mortgage</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.359" end="01:07:52.240" style="s2">is seriously overdue. Per the agreement,</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.760" end="01:07:54.400" style="s2">we&#39;re here to seize the property. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.240" end="01:07:56.880" style="s2">just a little short on cash. Give me a</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.400" end="01:07:59.599" style="s2">few more days. Sorry, this is the final</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.880" end="01:08:02.599" style="s2">deadline. Change the locks. Make it</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.599" end="01:08:02.599" style="s2">quick.</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.640" end="01:08:17.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello,</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.520" end="01:08:19.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase. We&#39;ve got a problem. Sasha</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.839" end="01:08:21.359" style="s2">transferred every scent in the company</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.359" end="01:08:22.239" style="s2">accounts to her personal accounts. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.359" end="01:08:25.120" style="s2">gone.</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.239" end="01:08:29.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call the police. Find her. I don&#39;t care</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.120" end="01:08:29.719" style="s2">where she runs. Bring her back.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.799" end="01:08:44.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me. What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.199" end="01:08:46.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, you&#39;re under arrest for</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.640" end="01:08:51.080" style="s2">embezzlement and grand lararseny. Turn</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.799" end="01:08:51.080" style="s2">around. Hands behind your back.</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.752" end="01:08:58.000" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.359" end="01:09:00.560" style="s2">Chase, help me. Tell them the money was</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.000" end="01:09:02.239" style="s2">a gift. You gave it to me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.560" end="01:09:04.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help you,</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.239" end="01:09:07.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sasha? After everything, you think I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.960" end="01:09:10.000" style="s2">still do anything for you,</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.759" end="01:09:13.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase? I was being chased by lone</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.000" end="01:09:14.560" style="s2">sharks. I had no choice. You can&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.199" end="01:09:17.199" style="s2">let me go down like this.</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.560" end="01:09:19.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I not treat you well? I trusted you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.199" end="01:09:21.279" style="s2">I indulged you. I gave you full control</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.040" end="01:09:23.440" style="s2">of company projects. And you drained</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.279" end="01:09:26.239" style="s2">what was left of my accounts. You lied.</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.440" end="01:09:28.319" style="s2">You schemed. You destroyed Reed Group.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.239" end="01:09:30.480" style="s2">Do you have any conscience at all?</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.319" end="01:09:32.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the one who&#39;s stupid. You had a</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.480" end="01:09:34.960" style="s2">perfect fianceé, Ivy, and you still got</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.319" end="01:09:37.839" style="s2">tangled up with me. You&#39;re arrogant. You</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.960" end="01:09:38.400" style="s2">got played. You got scammed. That&#39;s on</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.839" end="01:09:42.880" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.400" end="01:09:46.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On me? You show zero remorse. Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.880" end="01:09:47.759" style="s2">We&#39;ll settle this in court.</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.159" end="01:09:49.120" style="s2">Sasha,</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.759" end="01:09:51.279" style="s2">I&#39;m going to make sure you spend the</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.120" end="01:09:52.960" style="s2">rest of your life in a cell thinking</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.279" end="01:09:55.920" style="s2">about what you did.</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.960" end="01:09:58.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, you have no heart. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.920" end="01:10:00.800" style="s2">coldblooded. I did everything for you</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.400" end="01:10:02.800" style="s2">and you&#39;re sending me to prison. I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.800" end="01:10:07.159" style="s2">let you get away with this. If I go</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.800" end="01:10:07.159" style="s2">down, you&#39;re coming with me.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.199" end="01:10:24.800" style="s2">Reed Group&#39;s payment is 2 months</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.960" end="01:10:29.080" style="s2">overdue. If we don&#39;t see the money</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.800" end="01:10:29.080" style="s2">today, we&#39;re filing for arbitration.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.320" end="01:10:44.239" style="s2">Chase, this loan&#39;s been due for weeks. I</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.640" end="01:10:47.239" style="s2">need an answer today. When&#39;s the money</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.239" end="01:10:47.239" style="s2">coming?</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.640" end="01:10:54.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Reedgroup&#39;s assets are frozen and your</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.560" end="01:10:56.080" style="s2">project&#39;s collapsed. If you stall any</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.480" end="01:10:59.080" style="s2">longer, we&#39;re filing for bankruptcy</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.080" end="01:10:59.080" style="s2">liquidation.</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.920" end="01:11:11.920" style="s2">Chase, stop fighting it. The company&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.199" end="01:11:14.719" style="s2">dead. We&#39;re out of options.</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.920" end="01:11:17.679" style="s2">Then what do I do? The only person who</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.719" end="01:11:20.080" style="s2">can save Reed Group now is Miss Kane. If</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.679" end="01:11:24.280" style="s2">she steps in, there&#39;s a chance.</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.080" end="01:11:24.280" style="s2">Otherwise, we&#39;re done in a week.</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.600" end="01:11:30.960" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.440" end="01:11:30.960" style="s2">I&#39;ll go beg her.</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.280" end="01:11:43.760" style="s2">Private party, no entry. I&#39;m Chase. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.520" end="01:11:46.000" style="s2">here to see Ivy. Miss Kane is inside</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.760" end="01:11:49.280" style="s2">celebrating her engagement to Leo.</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.000" end="01:11:52.520" style="s2">Everyone here is invited. No invitation,</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.280" end="01:11:52.520" style="s2">no entry.</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.879" end="01:11:57.209" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.189" end="01:11:57.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.199" end="01:12:08.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; say</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.289" end="01:12:12.040" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.040" end="01:12:12.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; stop</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.360" end="01:12:17.040" style="s2">hurt my knee.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.000" end="01:12:18.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.040" end="01:12:19.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was wrong before. Can you give me</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.960" end="01:12:20.960" style="s2">another chance?</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.679" end="01:12:23.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the one who said I wasn&#39;t good</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.960" end="01:12:25.120" style="s2">enough. You called off the engagement.</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.040" end="01:12:28.239" style="s2">Today is my engagement party with two.</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.120" end="01:12:30.719" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.239" end="01:12:34.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two escort him out.</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.719" end="01:12:36.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not leaving. I know I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.640" end="01:12:37.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know you were wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.239" end="01:12:38.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know Reed Group is about to go under</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.520" end="01:12:40.080" style="s2">and you can&#39;t do a thing about it. So</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.719" end="01:12:41.280" style="s2">you came to me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.080" end="01:12:43.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I weren&#39;t a cane, would you be here</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.280" end="01:12:45.040" style="s2">apologizing? No. You never loved me. And</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.760" end="01:12:45.840" style="s2">now you&#39;re crashing my engagement party.</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.040" end="01:12:47.120" style="s2">You&#39;re pathetic.</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.840" end="01:12:48.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not true. Let me explain.</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.120" end="01:12:50.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s there to explain? For a whole</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.960" end="01:12:51.520" style="s2">year, I reached out to you again and</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.239" end="01:12:52.719" style="s2">again. You turned me down every single</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.520" end="01:12:56.719" style="s2">time. And every single time it was</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.719" end="01:12:59.280" style="s2">because of the same person, Sasha.</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.719" end="01:13:00.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, you free tonight? I made your</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.280" end="01:13:04.920" style="s2">favorite.</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.159" end="01:13:04.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m having dinner with Sasha.</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.840" end="01:13:14.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chase, Ivy made you a birthday cake</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.400" end="01:13:16.560" style="s2">herself. She&#39;s asking what time you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.880" end="01:13:19.199" style="s2">be home.</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.560" end="01:13:22.640" style="s2">Tell her I&#39;m not coming home. Sasha&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.199" end="01:13:22.640" style="s2">throwing me a party.</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.760" end="01:13:32.640" style="s2">What was I doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.640" end="01:13:33.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Love that comes so late means nothing. I</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.640" end="01:13:34.560" style="s2">don&#39;t need fake love. I need someone</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.840" end="01:13:35.520" style="s2">who&#39;s always there.</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.560" end="01:13:36.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can be that. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.520" end="01:13:40.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too late.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.239" end="01:13:42.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you still love me, it&#39;s not too late.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.320" end="01:13:44.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, I&#39;ll admit it. You&#39;re good-looking.</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.719" end="01:13:46.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I&#39;m not the type to lose my head</p>
<p begin="01:13:44.000" end="01:13:48.000" style="s2">over a pretty face. And honestly, Leo&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.400" end="01:13:49.520" style="s2">better looking. We just grew up</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.000" end="01:13:51.040" style="s2">together. I always saw him as a friend.</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.520" end="01:13:52.080" style="s2">I never let myself think about it.</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.040" end="01:13:52.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just saying that because you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.080" end="01:13:54.400" style="s2">mad at me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.640" end="01:13:57.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not mad. I&#39;m grateful. Grateful that</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.400" end="01:13:59.120" style="s2">God put Leo in my life. All these years,</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.040" end="01:14:01.280" style="s2">he&#39;s been there. When I&#39;m happy, he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.120" end="01:14:03.520" style="s2">happy with me. When I&#39;m sad, he finds a</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.280" end="01:14:05.679" style="s2">way to make me smile. Every time I got</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.520" end="01:14:07.040" style="s2">sick, he showed up. No matter what, he</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.679" end="01:14:08.239" style="s2">was there. Even when I was honoring that</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.040" end="01:14:09.360" style="s2">engagement, he never gave up on me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.239" end="01:14:11.679" style="s2">Leo&#39;s the one I want to walk through</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.360" end="01:14:15.361" style="s2">life with. The one I love. As for you,</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.679" end="01:14:16.239" style="s2">stay out of my life.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.361" end="01:14:18.400" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.239" end="01:14:19.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I get it. I won&#39;t bother you</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.400" end="01:14:22.239" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.679" end="01:14:24.080" style="s2">But can you do one last thing for Reed</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.239" end="01:14:28.040" style="s2">Group for old time&#39;s sake? Otherwise,</p>
<p begin="01:14:24.080" end="01:14:28.040" style="s2">the Reed family is finished.</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.631" end="01:14:39.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.640" end="01:14:56.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kain Group has officially acquired a</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.480" end="01:14:59.360" style="s2">majority stake in Reed Group. Effective</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.880" end="01:15:02.159" style="s2">today, I&#39;m CEO of Reed Group and Miss</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.360" end="01:15:03.920" style="s2">Kaine is chairwoman. Let me be clear. I</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.159" end="01:15:06.960" style="s2">don&#39;t keep people who kiss up and step</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.920" end="01:15:06.960" style="s2">on others.</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.000" end="01:15:15.840" style="s2">Ivy. Ivy, I need to talk to you. Thank</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.920" end="01:15:17.679" style="s2">you for taking over Reed Groupoup.</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.840" end="01:15:19.440" style="s2">Without Can Group&#39;s investment, Reed</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.679" end="01:15:21.760" style="s2">Groupoup would have been bankrupt.</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.440" end="01:15:24.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t thank me. My father asked me to do</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.760" end="01:15:25.840" style="s2">it for old time&#39;s sake. If that&#39;s all,</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.320" end="01:15:29.040" style="s2">I&#39;m leaving.</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.840" end="01:15:31.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. I did a lot of things wrong. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.040" end="01:15:34.640" style="s2">sorry. Truly,</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.040" end="01:15:38.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve moved on. You should, too. And when</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.640" end="01:15:41.719" style="s2">I said I liked you, I meant it,</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.719" end="01:15:41.719" style="s2">Ivy.</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.120" end="01:15:52.719" style="s2">Ivy, from now on, be happy.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.600" end="01:15:56.080" style="s2">If I hadn&#39;t been so arrogant,</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.719" end="01:16:00.120" style="s2">if I hadn&#39;t let my pride blind me,</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.080" end="01:16:00.120" style="s2">would things have turned out different?</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
